(752818, 81622, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  It is however, a bit overexposed and tilted.  The tilt is easy to fix in PS.  Message me after the challenge if you need help with this issue.  The overexposure looks to be due to on board flash.  Not using flash and using a tripod would help with this...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice concept.  It is however, a bit overexposed and tilted.  The tilt is easy to fix in PS.  Message me after the challenge if you need help with this issue.  The overexposure looks to be due to on board flash.  Not using flash and using a tripod would help with this...TC', '2004-06-07 02:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
