(753149, 81817, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love the unusual perspective you''ve used here.  The lines of the house are very interesting, and the water tower leads your eye further into the photo.  The upper third of the shot seems wasted to me, however - there''s nothing in that gray sky that adds to the picture.  Nice job, nonetheless.</td>', 'I love the unusual perspective you''ve used here.  The lines of the house are very interesting, and the water tower leads your eye further into the photo.  The upper third of the shot seems wasted to me, however - there''s nothing in that gray sky that adds to the picture.  Nice job, nonetheless.', '2004-06-07 10:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(753151, 80816, 5391, '<td valign="top">It seems the foreground here is in focus but the rest is not.  Lovely composition, a postcard-worthy shot, but not really in line with the challenge theme.</td>', 'It seems the foreground here is in focus but the rest is not.  Lovely composition, a postcard-worthy shot, but not really in line with the challenge theme.', '2004-06-07 10:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(753152, 81170, 5391, '<td valign="top">The uneven lighting is distracting, but you''ve nailed the deep DOF pretty well.</td>', 'The uneven lighting is distracting, but you''ve nailed the deep DOF pretty well.', '2004-06-07 10:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(753156, 81455, 5391, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh...  Lovely work, meets the challenge perfectly.  Great tonal range, with details visible in both the blacks and whites.  Good choice for a b/w shot - those clouds really give the image punch.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh...  Lovely work, meets the challenge perfectly.  Great tonal range, with details visible in both the blacks and whites.  Good choice for a b/w shot - those clouds really give the image punch.', '2004-06-07 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(753158, 81902, 5391, '<td valign="top">Positively majestic shot of these two beautiful animals.  Great sky, excellent use of the challenge theme and nice choice of lens to add depth from this angle.  I don''t care too much for the darkness around the edges of the image, but that''s just my personal taste.  Well done, nonetheless.  9</td>', 'Positively majestic shot of these two beautiful animals.  Great sky, excellent use of the challenge theme and nice choice of lens to add depth from this angle.  I don''t care too much for the darkness around the edges of the image, but that''s just my personal taste.  Well done, nonetheless.  9', '2004-06-07 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(753161, 81962, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really interesting and unusual perspective.  Nice choice of lens to really take something that might be chaotic and uninteresting, otherwise, and really add a sense of being there.  Unusual, but I like it.  I think this is one that would grow more and more on me every time I look at it.</td>', 'Really interesting and unusual perspective.  Nice choice of lens to really take something that might be chaotic and uninteresting, otherwise, and really add a sense of being there.  Unusual, but I like it.  I think this is one that would grow more and more on me every time I look at it.', '2004-06-07 10:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(753163, 81789, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the path to lead your eye through the photo.  Everything is in focus, meeting the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Very nice use of the path to lead your eye through the photo.  Everything is in focus, meeting the challenge perfectly.', '2004-06-07 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(753165, 81957, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good use of a longer lens to flatten out the image.  Creative idea, well done.  Well lit and composed, including no disturbing reflections in the spanner/wrench, and that vivid blue eye in the middle of the whole shot really catches your attention.  I like this more the more I look at it.  Good work!</td>', 'Good use of a longer lens to flatten out the image.  Creative idea, well done.  Well lit and composed, including no disturbing reflections in the spanner/wrench, and that vivid blue eye in the middle of the whole shot really catches your attention.  I like this more the more I look at it.  Good work!', '2004-06-07 10:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(753166, 81831, 20204, '<td valign="top">The DOF is nice, but the image is lacking interest.  The sky has no drama, the pines and grass are very constant...  I like the composition in some ways, but I think the only way this would work for me is if there had been a dramatic sky.</td>', 'The DOF is nice, but the image is lacking interest.  The sky has no drama, the pines and grass are very constant...  I like the composition in some ways, but I think the only way this would work for me is if there had been a dramatic sky.', '2004-06-07 10:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(753169, 81394, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the way this image has interest in foreground and background.  Feels like some hotspots on the statue, and a bit too much sky, but otherwise a very interesting image.</td>', 'I like the way this image has interest in foreground and background.  Feels like some hotspots on the statue, and a bit too much sky, but otherwise a very interesting image.', '2004-06-07 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(753174, 81670, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  I love the soft colors mixed with the crisp focus throughout.  Lovely clouds add depth to that beautiful sky, as well.</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  I love the soft colors mixed with the crisp focus throughout.  Lovely clouds add depth to that beautiful sky, as well.', '2004-06-07 10:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(753175, 80826, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking that for  a deep depth of field image you''d want both foregounrd and background to be in focus.  This is clearly a challow DOF.  However, I *really* love the shot as I''m a dog lover, and this captures the insatiable curiosity of our canine buddies to me.  wrong challenge, but very cute shot.</td>', 'I''m thinking that for  a deep depth of field image you''d want both foregounrd and background to be in focus.  This is clearly a challow DOF.  However, I *really* love the shot as I''m a dog lover, and this captures the insatiable curiosity of our canine buddies to me.  wrong challenge, but very cute shot.', '2004-06-07 10:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(753176, 81806, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Dang, there goes any hope I had for first place in this challenge, lol.  Simply spectacular use of a wide-angle lens to add amazing drama to the sky.  The single figure is really highlighted by the depth of the image, and the overall saturaed, moody tones make this a winner.  I predict a ribbon...  10</td>', 'Wow.  Dang, there goes any hope I had for first place in this challenge, lol.  Simply spectacular use of a wide-angle lens to add amazing drama to the sky.  The single figure is really highlighted by the depth of the image, and the overall saturaed, moody tones make this a winner.  I predict a ribbon...  10', '2004-06-07 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(753178, 81902, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!  Dramatic sky, dramatic point of view.  Honestly one of the most pleasing images I''ve seen since joining DPC.</td>', 'This is stunning!  Dramatic sky, dramatic point of view.  Honestly one of the most pleasing images I''ve seen since joining DPC.', '2004-06-07 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(753181, 81591, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is a lovely, peaceful shot.  Good use of the challenge topic.</td>', 'Oh, this is a lovely, peaceful shot.  Good use of the challenge topic.', '2004-06-07 10:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(753183, 81727, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m dying to know how this was done - amazing!</td>', 'I''m dying to know how this was done - amazing!', '2004-06-07 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(753184, 81727, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I like it!</td>', 'Very creative!  I like it!', '2004-06-07 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(753185, 81907, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, good use of the deep DOF technique, too.</td>', 'Very pretty, good use of the deep DOF technique, too.', '2004-06-07 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(753186, 81533, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and the "Jack and the Beanstalk" feel of this image, but the overexposure on the lower parts of the plat are very distracting for me.  Your creativity and originality here is an 8+, but the final product fell a bit short to me.</td>', 'I love the perspective and the "Jack and the Beanstalk" feel of this image, but the overexposure on the lower parts of the plat are very distracting for me.  Your creativity and originality here is an 8+, but the final product fell a bit short to me.', '2004-06-07 10:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(753187, 81837, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - an eye-catching image, to be sure.  Kind of makes my eyes go goofy on me.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Wow - an eye-catching image, to be sure.  Kind of makes my eyes go goofy on me.  Very pretty.', '2004-06-07 10:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(753189, 81008, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Beautiful shot!  9</td>', 'Wow!  Beautiful shot!  9', '2004-06-07 10:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(753190, 81942, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Excellent clarity throughout. This is one of the best in the challenge. Great job!</td>', 'Really nice shot. Excellent clarity throughout. This is one of the best in the challenge. Great job!', '2004-06-07 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(753191, 81799, 20204, '<td valign="top">Amazing - the building looks transluscent!  I''d like to a see abit more contrast on the building''s edges to set it off from the sky, but very clever composition.</td>', 'Amazing - the building looks transluscent!  I''d like to a see abit more contrast on the building''s edges to set it off from the sky, but very clever composition.', '2004-06-07 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(753192, 81135, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice job.  Not only have you gotten the focus spot-on, the composition and tonal range are both really nice, too.  8</td>', 'Very nice job.  Not only have you gotten the focus spot-on, the composition and tonal range are both really nice, too.  8', '2004-06-07 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753193, 81964, 19952, '<td valign="top">What an excellent deep DOF shot. You framed the monument perfectly. Really nice job!</td>', 'What an excellent deep DOF shot. You framed the monument perfectly. Really nice job!', '2004-06-07 10:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(753194, 81957, 20204, '<td valign="top">*Very* creative!  Great clean background really emphasizes the sbuject(s).  Nice composition as well.</td>', '*Very* creative!  Great clean background really emphasizes the sbuject(s).  Nice composition as well.', '2004-06-07 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753195, 81826, 5391, '<td valign="top">The different lighting throughout the picture really makes this a challenge for proper exposure.  With a little fill light on the front flamingo,  you wouldn''t have the burned out spots on the backs of the two birds further from the camera.  That being said, it''s nicely done compositionally and clearly fits the challenge.</td>', 'The different lighting throughout the picture really makes this a challenge for proper exposure.  With a little fill light on the front flamingo,  you wouldn''t have the burned out spots on the backs of the two birds further from the camera.  That being said, it''s nicely done compositionally and clearly fits the challenge.', '2004-06-07 10:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(753196, 81591, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great job finding a landscape shot with such prominent objects in the foreground. This is an excellent photo - one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Great job finding a landscape shot with such prominent objects in the foreground. This is an excellent photo - one of the best in the challenge.', '2004-06-07 10:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(753199, 81112, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is very clearly not deep depth of field to me, with the background being so out of focus.  Beautiful composition, nonetheless.</td>', 'This is very clearly not deep depth of field to me, with the background being so out of focus.  Beautiful composition, nonetheless.', '2004-06-07 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(753202, 81651, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent job using deep DOF.</td>', 'Excellent job using deep DOF.', '2004-06-07 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(753204, 81132, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot and you got so much clarity in the underwater rocks. Really great job!</td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot and you got so much clarity in the underwater rocks. Really great job!', '2004-06-07 10:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(753205, 81477, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh!  They look so cute and happy!  My dogs NEVER do this for a photo.  Good use of deep DOF.  Looks like a little camera shake, perhaps, but you get a bonus point for cute, well-behaved dogs.  :)</td>', 'Oh!  They look so cute and happy!  My dogs NEVER do this for a photo.  Good use of deep DOF.  Looks like a little camera shake, perhaps, but you get a bonus point for cute, well-behaved dogs.  :)', '2004-06-07 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(753209, 81528, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity.  Really well done!</td>', 'Great color and clarity.  Really well done!', '2004-06-07 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(753210, 81768, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and a nice example of deep DOF. Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful shot and a nice example of deep DOF. Great job!', '2004-06-07 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(753212, 81312, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - excellent clarity and color throughout. Really great job!</td>', 'Beautiful shot - excellent clarity and color throughout. Really great job!', '2004-06-07 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(753214, 81708, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very Escher-like.  Wow.  I''m not wild about this high of contrast normally, but I think that the more I look at it, it really fits this image.  Let me know if you make a print of this available.  It''s really, really cool.  10</td>', 'Very Escher-like.  Wow.  I''m not wild about this high of contrast normally, but I think that the more I look at it, it really fits this image.  Let me know if you make a print of this available.  It''s really, really cool.  10', '2004-06-07 10:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(753216, 81708, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a classic Escher style - really creative to implement it photographically, and the b/w is perfect for it.</td>', 'This is a classic Escher style - really creative to implement it photographically, and the b/w is perfect for it.', '2004-06-07 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(753217, 81150, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the way this is composed to take advantage of the rail''s angle.  Very creative.</td>', 'I love the way this is composed to take advantage of the rail''s angle.  Very creative.', '2004-06-07 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(753218, 81708, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge. Not only is this photo crisp and clear throughout, but it also shows a strong sense of style and creativity. Really nice job.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge. Not only is this photo crisp and clear throughout, but it also shows a strong sense of style and creativity. Really nice job.', '2004-06-07 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(753219, 80837, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good composition and use of deep DOF.  The leading line of the water is very attractive, as is the hillside on the left that breaks up the composition.</td>', 'Very nice, good composition and use of deep DOF.  The leading line of the water is very attractive, as is the hillside on the left that breaks up the composition.', '2004-06-07 10:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(753222, 81837, 20204, '<td valign="top">Noe *that''s* what I call good use of macro style.  Great abstract!</td>', 'Noe *that''s* what I call good use of macro style.  Great abstract!', '2004-06-07 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(753223, 81953, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The colors make this feel like a dreamy painting, and the composition being broken up into triangles of earthy, moody colors so neatly really is a master stroke of genius.  Just positively gorgeous.  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The colors make this feel like a dreamy painting, and the composition being broken up into triangles of earthy, moody colors so neatly really is a master stroke of genius.  Just positively gorgeous.  10', '2004-06-07 10:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753225, 81591, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this image that (to me) wants to be b/w or sepia.  Color seems to emphasize the individual elements, which aren''t all that interesting on their own.  Yet, you''ve captured a mood with this and non color formats tend to convey modds better.  Again, that''s just how I see this image - it''s a nice shot either way.</td>', 'There''s something about this image that (to me) wants to be b/w or sepia.  Color seems to emphasize the individual elements, which aren''t all that interesting on their own.  Yet, you''ve captured a mood with this and non color formats tend to convey modds better.  Again, that''s just how I see this image - it''s a nice shot either way.', '2004-06-07 11:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(753226, 81426, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - touching shot, very creatively done with the color vs. b/w and good use of the deep dof.  There''s some sort of blur or soft focus in the highlights that adds a bit of surrealness to this.  Very artistic, speaks volumes.  Nice, interesting piece of work.</td>', 'Wow - touching shot, very creatively done with the color vs. b/w and good use of the deep dof.  There''s some sort of blur or soft focus in the highlights that adds a bit of surrealness to this.  Very artistic, speaks volumes.  Nice, interesting piece of work.', '2004-06-07 11:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(753234, 81902, 18820, '<td valign="top">Great Picture...I love the lighting</td>', 'Great Picture...I love the lighting', '2004-06-07 11:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(753235, 81832, 20204, '<td valign="top">Deep DOF would require that all three of these be in focus.  Interesting subject, but definitely not meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Deep DOF would require that all three of these be in focus.  Interesting subject, but definitely not meeting the challenge.', '2004-06-07 11:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(753242, 81822, 14614, '<td valign="top">lovely scene you''ve set.  the clouds set a great background, flowers/grass foreground and your main element gets lots of attention.  Your shot has what few others (that I''ve seen so far) lack -- a "focal point"</td>', 'lovely scene you''ve set.  the clouds set a great background, flowers/grass foreground and your main element gets lots of attention.  Your shot has what few others (that I''ve seen so far) lack -- a "focal point"', '2004-06-07 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753246, 81696, 14614, '<td valign="top">great composition - not only a deep dof but a "focal point" as well</td>', 'great composition - not only a deep dof but a "focal point" as well', '2004-06-07 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(753249, 81964, 14614, '<td valign="top">good use of natural framing, great dof.</td>', 'good use of natural framing, great dof.', '2004-06-07 11:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(753252, 81723, 18068, '<td valign="top">Really stunning, the first picture i though was worth looking at for more then 2 seconds so far ;)</td>', 'Really stunning, the first picture i though was worth looking at for more then 2 seconds so far ;)', '2004-06-07 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(753259, 81806, 18068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of open space, an overall well done composition. The only thing that i would have done differently here would be to make the cloudsobve the grass line a bit brighter. Good Job ;)</td>', 'Beautiful use of open space, an overall well done composition. The only thing that i would have done differently here would be to make the cloudsobve the grass line a bit brighter. Good Job ;)', '2004-06-07 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(753260, 80826, 5391, '<td valign="top">Holy cow.  I have to say, I don''t think it meets the challenge very well due to the background being oof...  That being said, this is SUCH a great shot!  Let me know if you make a print available - I LOVE this.</td>', 'Holy cow.  I have to say, I don''t think it meets the challenge very well due to the background being oof...  That being said, this is SUCH a great shot!  Let me know if you make a print available - I LOVE this.', '2004-06-07 11:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(753267, 81135, 18068, '<td valign="top">very nice ;). What did you use for the background?????</td>', 'very nice ;). What did you use for the background?????', '2004-06-07 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(753271, 81832, 5391, '<td valign="top">Definitely, and unfortunately, short depth of field, not deep depth of field.  Great job on the white background and composition, however.</td>', 'Definitely, and unfortunately, short depth of field, not deep depth of field.  Great job on the white background and composition, however.', '2004-06-07 11:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(753273, 81186, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and nice composition.</td>', 'Very pretty and nice composition.', '2004-06-07 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(753275, 81942, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Interesting perspective, really makes your use of deep DOF stand out.</td>', 'Wow!  Interesting perspective, really makes your use of deep DOF stand out.', '2004-06-07 11:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(753277, 81069, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  This is an amazing shot.  Perfect exposure, composition, just really beautiful.  Highly publishable.  10</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  This is an amazing shot.  Perfect exposure, composition, just really beautiful.  Highly publishable.  10', '2004-06-07 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(753279, 81832, 6630, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but the DOF is very shallow, which, I''m sorry to say, is the total opposite of what the challenge was supposed to be.</td>', 'I like this shot, but the DOF is very shallow, which, I''m sorry to say, is the total opposite of what the challenge was supposed to be.', '2004-06-07 11:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(753280, 81677, 6630, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF</td>', 'Shallow DOF', '2004-06-07 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(753281, 81660, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very, very pretty waterfall with slow shutter speed to turn those drops of water into angel hair.  Good presentation, fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Very, very pretty waterfall with slow shutter speed to turn those drops of water into angel hair.  Good presentation, fits the challenge well.', '2004-06-07 11:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(753282, 81825, 5391, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot like this makes me want to sell my camera on ebay.  :)  Congrats on a great images that fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'A beautiful shot like this makes me want to sell my camera on ebay.  :)  Congrats on a great images that fits the challenge very well.', '2004-06-07 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(753283, 81132, 20210, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, better make top 10, given the other stuff I''ve seen entered.  Congrats.  I wish the background mountains weren''t quite so washed out.  If the exposure were perfect top to bottom, I''d give it the top score.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, better make top 10, given the other stuff I''ve seen entered.  Congrats.  I wish the background mountains weren''t quite so washed out.  If the exposure were perfect top to bottom, I''d give it the top score.', '2004-06-07 11:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(753285, 81697, 20210, '<td valign="top">good DOF, but an ugly subject, especially with that water tower in the background.</td>', 'good DOF, but an ugly subject, especially with that water tower in the background.', '2004-06-07 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(753288, 81820, 20210, '<td valign="top">this was a very tough exposure.  technically impossible, I expect.  But a very good try, and a great photo.  just don''t know if the exposure and saturation levels are enough for a top spot.</td>', 'this was a very tough exposure.  technically impossible, I expect.  But a very good try, and a great photo.  just don''t know if the exposure and saturation levels are enough for a top spot.', '2004-06-07 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(753289, 81128, 327, '<td valign="top">For me this could be a winner. I really like it. Compliments only.</td>', 'For me this could be a winner. I really like it. Compliments only.', '2004-06-07 11:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(753290, 81312, 327, '<td valign="top">Compliments only. Great clean clear shot.</td>', 'Compliments only. Great clean clear shot.', '2004-06-07 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(753291, 81524, 327, '<td valign="top">Compliments only.</td>', 'Compliments only.', '2004-06-07 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(753292, 81915, 327, '<td valign="top">Why did you need to remove the background?</td>', 'Why did you need to remove the background?', '2004-06-07 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(753294, 81507, 327, '<td valign="top">dof is pretty shallow here and the flowers seem a bit oof. I do love this for the nice colors.</td>', 'dof is pretty shallow here and the flowers seem a bit oof. I do love this for the nice colors.', '2004-06-07 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(753295, 81008, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue colors.</td>', 'Beautiful blue colors.', '2004-06-07 11:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(753296, 81945, 327, '<td valign="top">The dof is hard to see with pines. :) Maybe if something was in the farground it would of helped this. Looks like a nice place.</td>', 'The dof is hard to see with pines. :) Maybe if something was in the farground it would of helped this. Looks like a nice place.', '2004-06-07 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(753297, 81927, 19035, '<td valign="top">I had a very similar shot in mind for this challenge, nice job.</td>', 'I had a very similar shot in mind for this challenge, nice job.', '2004-06-07 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(753298, 81832, 327, '<td valign="top">seems the dof is shallow here. Still the morrels are cool looking. Great shapes and I like the shadows.</td>', 'seems the dof is shallow here. Still the morrels are cool looking. Great shapes and I like the shadows.', '2004-06-07 11:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(753309, 81909, 20210, '<td valign="top">ha, funny.  is that a painting in the background?  anyway, very clever shot.  I wonder if you''ll get DQ requests, it very much looks like two photos combined in PS.</td>', 'ha, funny.  is that a painting in the background?  anyway, very clever shot.  I wonder if you''ll get DQ requests, it very much looks like two photos combined in PS.', '2004-06-07 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(753316, 81341, 20210, '<td valign="top">did you use a flash for this?  the circle of lighting is a little odd, maybe just the way the trees cast their shadows.</td>', 'did you use a flash for this?  the circle of lighting is a little odd, maybe just the way the trees cast their shadows.', '2004-06-07 12:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
