(753682, 81723, 14603, '<td valign="top">I believe you...taken from South Queensferry on the wee road that takes you to Cramond and the light is on the correct side of the bridge for that time of day.<br/>This shot is an absolute beauty..well worth getting up early for.<br/>Well done...10</td>', 'I believe you...taken from South Queensferry on the wee road that takes you to Cramond and the light is on the correct side of the bridge for that time of day.This shot is an absolute beauty..well worth getting up early for.Well done...10', '2004-06-07 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(753694, 81455, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very moody &amp; atmospheric shot with the tree branch ? in the foreground helping to tie in the deep dof perfectly.</td>', 'Very moody & atmospheric shot with the tree branch ? in the foreground helping to tie in the deep dof perfectly.', '2004-06-07 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(753704, 81911, 14603, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition in this shot..the gentle downward slope of the mountain and the perspective created by the canoes seems to be leading the eye through and out of the picture.<br/>Nicely done...9</td>', 'Really like the composition in this shot..the gentle downward slope of the mountain and the perspective created by the canoes seems to be leading the eye through and out of the picture.Nicely done...9', '2004-06-07 17:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(753705, 81426, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very poignant and also very powerful.</td>', 'Very poignant and also very powerful.', '2004-06-07 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(753708, 81788, 6999, '<td valign="top">Man, I have to vote on this just to get it off the thumbnails page. And you forgot the bin in your (hugely annoying) title. decent shot - highly contrasty and typical of v harsh midday sun, though, and perhaps not simple and graphic enough to really make the most of that light. 5</td>', 'Man, I have to vote on this just to get it off the thumbnails page. And you forgot the bin in your (hugely annoying) title. decent shot - highly contrasty and typical of v harsh midday sun, though, and perhaps not simple and graphic enough to really make the most of that light. 5', '2004-06-07 17:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(753721, 81915, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is just too crudely produced to take seriously!</td>', 'This is just too crudely produced to take seriously!', '2004-06-07 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(753728, 81825, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and very atmospheric</td>', 'Nicely composed and very atmospheric', '2004-06-07 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(753734, 81806, 6999, '<td valign="top">The mood, those clouds ... this would seem to cry out for a black and white treatment to me. That said, the muted blues, and the greens and the red shirt do have an impact entirely down to their colours. Great sky - if it''s burnt, it''s done very well (against the dpc trend). I guess it will score well, though, I have reservations personally about it - kind of too obvious for me, if you follow.</td>', 'The mood, those clouds ... this would seem to cry out for a black and white treatment to me. That said, the muted blues, and the greens and the red shirt do have an impact entirely down to their colours. Great sky - if it''s burnt, it''s done very well (against the dpc trend). I guess it will score well, though, I have reservations personally about it - kind of too obvious for me, if you follow.', '2004-06-07 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(753741, 81696, 14603, '<td valign="top">Taken at the right time of day to make good use of the light<br/>Lovely shot</td>', 'Taken at the right time of day to make good use of the lightLovely shot', '2004-06-07 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(753743, 81837, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost, anyway! Serious bit of cloning work needed, especially in such a dramatically graphic macro. Like the effect though, but you''re really struggling with sharpness toward the edge of frame, and there isn''t actually anything to suggest exactly how deep or otherwise your dof was here.</td>', 'Almost, anyway! Serious bit of cloning work needed, especially in such a dramatically graphic macro. Like the effect though, but you''re really struggling with sharpness toward the edge of frame, and there isn''t actually anything to suggest exactly how deep or otherwise your dof was here.', '2004-06-07 17:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(753746, 81069, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great capture..this idea works very well for the challenge.</td>', 'Great capture..this idea works very well for the challenge.', '2004-06-07 17:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(753751, 81298, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and superb clarity.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and superb clarity.', '2004-06-07 17:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
