(753857, 80826, 19672, '<td valign="top">I am unfamiliar with Deep Depth of Field but I thought it was either ALL (both fore and background were in focus) or background was in focus and foreground was blurred. This doesn''t seem to be either.... *ponder*  Cute photo though...but I think it''s just a nose shy of meeting the submission subject....</td>', 'I am unfamiliar with Deep Depth of Field but I thought it was either ALL (both fore and background were in focus) or background was in focus and foreground was blurred. This doesn''t seem to be either.... *ponder*  Cute photo though...but I think it''s just a nose shy of meeting the submission subject....', '2004-06-07 18:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
