(754332, 81723, 12160, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, well-composed, colors are good. one of my top picks. 10</td>', 'very nice shot, well-composed, colors are good. one of my top picks. 10', '2004-06-08 00:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754348, 81800, 19009, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Christmas Tree with the clouds as the branches.</td>', 'Looks like a Christmas Tree with the clouds as the branches.', '2004-06-08 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(754350, 81820, 19009, '<td valign="top">Looks like Lancaster. Nice shot.</td>', 'Looks like Lancaster. Nice shot.', '2004-06-08 00:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(754352, 81747, 19009, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Plays well.</td>', 'Neat idea.  Plays well.', '2004-06-08 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(754355, 81905, 19009, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2004-06-08 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(754359, 81776, 19009, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-06-08 00:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(754383, 81942, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice sense of depth.   The cross looks a little too far tilted to the left.  I might have tried rotating the whole thing to the right to balance it, even if the flower would then be tilted.  Should have removed that dead stem in the foreground.  I would have also pulled out a pair of sicsors and clipped those tall pieces of grass.  OK maybe that''s a little too much. :)</td>', 'Pretty nice sense of depth.   The cross looks a little too far tilted to the left.  I might have tried rotating the whole thing to the right to balance it, even if the flower would then be tilted.  Should have removed that dead stem in the foreground.  I would have also pulled out a pair of sicsors and clipped those tall pieces of grass.  OK maybe that''s a little too much. :)', '2004-06-08 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(754384, 81946, 4494, '<td valign="top">I''m sure all the pieces are in focus but, the problem is, you don''t get a feel of that because the shot isn''t close enough.  You should have zoomed in more (or cropped) to give the viewer more sense of the depth.  From this perspective, it looks like you are 2 or 3 chessboards away from the chessboard, if that makes sense.</td>', 'I''m sure all the pieces are in focus but, the problem is, you don''t get a feel of that because the shot isn''t close enough.  You should have zoomed in more (or cropped) to give the viewer more sense of the depth.  From this perspective, it looks like you are 2 or 3 chessboards away from the chessboard, if that makes sense.', '2004-06-08 00:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754387, 81507, 4494, '<td valign="top">Opps this is SHALLOW depth of field.  LOL, this challenge is for deeeeep dof.  Live and learn.  Don''t forget to use Levels to correct your colors.  And Curves (or levels) to get more contrast.</td>', 'Opps this is SHALLOW depth of field.  LOL, this challenge is for deeeeep dof.  Live and learn.  Don''t forget to use Levels to correct your colors.  And Curves (or levels) to get more contrast.', '2004-06-08 00:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(754390, 81809, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell if the sillouettes are in focus.  This is a great shot otherwise, awesome sports shot, and great Title.  I''d give you 8 if this were the "Sillouette" challenge. :)</td>', 'Hard to tell if the sillouettes are in focus.  This is a great shot otherwise, awesome sports shot, and great Title.  I''d give you 8 if this were the "Sillouette" challenge. :)', '2004-06-08 00:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(754392, 81963, 4494, '<td valign="top">Kind of boring subject.  Don''t be afraid to get off the beatin track, there, and look for something else.</td>', 'Kind of boring subject.  Don''t be afraid to get off the beatin track, there, and look for something else.', '2004-06-08 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(754394, 81341, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if anything is really in focus.  I might have tried a close up of just 3 or 4 head stones.  Nice subject anyway.   DDOF is not impressive if the distance to your subject is a realitively great distance.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if anything is really in focus.  I might have tried a close up of just 3 or 4 head stones.  Nice subject anyway.   DDOF is not impressive if the distance to your subject is a realitively great distance.', '2004-06-08 00:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(754395, 81531, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, good one.  Great subject, nice job.  It would look even better if you cropped this by cutting 2 inches off the top.  Then it would be a much stronger effect I think.  You should have also titled to the right (a lot) in order to remove the out of focus rock on the left. :)</td>', 'Ohhh, good one.  Great subject, nice job.  It would look even better if you cropped this by cutting 2 inches off the top.  Then it would be a much stronger effect I think.  You should have also titled to the right (a lot) in order to remove the out of focus rock on the left. :)', '2004-06-08 00:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(754398, 81132, 22699, '<td valign="top">What a breathtaking view. I love how clear the water is and that you can see the rocks on the bottom. Beautiful.</td>', 'What a breathtaking view. I love how clear the water is and that you can see the rocks on the bottom. Beautiful.', '2004-06-08 00:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(754399, 81533, 22699, '<td valign="top">What a unique view.</td>', 'What a unique view.', '2004-06-08 00:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(754400, 80457, 4494, '<td valign="top">It would be even more impressive you have held up a perfectly in focus beer can in front of the camera. :D  You''d probably need an apprature of F2340922 to do that?</td>', 'It would be even more impressive you have held up a perfectly in focus beer can in front of the camera. :D  You''d probably need an apprature of F2340922 to do that?', '2004-06-08 00:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(754402, 81781, 22699, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring in this piece. It almost makes me feel as though I am right there, soaking up the sun while the clouds loom over the city. Nice.</td>', 'I like the coloring in this piece. It almost makes me feel as though I am right there, soaking up the sun while the clouds loom over the city. Nice.', '2004-06-08 00:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(754408, 81553, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, are you the person who was asking about removing the apprature blades from a lens in the forum last week?!  Hahaha, you actually DID it!   Very cool, I''ve always wondered how these things worked.  But I warned you, the lens is ruined now. :)</td>', 'LOL, are you the person who was asking about removing the apprature blades from a lens in the forum last week?!  Hahaha, you actually DID it!   Very cool, I''ve always wondered how these things worked.  But I warned you, the lens is ruined now. :)', '2004-06-08 01:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(754411, 81651, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hmm, probably the best of the scenary images for this.  Good job, the front flowers look in focus and so does the horizon.  Without the trees it would be hard to tell.</td>', 'Hmm, probably the best of the scenary images for this.  Good job, the front flowers look in focus and so does the horizon.  Without the trees it would be hard to tell.', '2004-06-08 01:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(754412, 81717, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ooops, the "window" is out of focus I think.</td>', 'Ooops, the "window" is out of focus I think.', '2004-06-08 01:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(754414, 81909, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, what happenned to the background??!  Looks EXTREMELY minipulated and/or over sharpened. :(   The coin looks pretty good however.</td>', 'LOL, what happenned to the background??!  Looks EXTREMELY minipulated and/or over sharpened. :(   The coin looks pretty good however.', '2004-06-08 01:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(754418, 81832, 4494, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, you''ve probably heard this already, but this is shallow dof, not deep. :(</td>', 'Uh oh, you''ve probably heard this already, but this is shallow dof, not deep. :(', '2004-06-08 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(754435, 81372, 4494, '<td valign="top">The foregound is out of focus and it takes up almost 1/2 the image. :(</td>', 'The foregound is out of focus and it takes up almost 1/2 the image. :(', '2004-06-08 01:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(754439, 81682, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  You should have tried to get a little closer to the woman hold the main line.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  You should have tried to get a little closer to the woman hold the main line.', '2004-06-08 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(754446, 81821, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s awesome!  Love those clouds they are perfect.  And the well lit flower in front is great.   The horizon tilt is driving my crazy but you couldn''t really do anything about that.</td>', 'Wow that''s awesome!  Love those clouds they are perfect.  And the well lit flower in front is great.   The horizon tilt is driving my crazy but you couldn''t really do anything about that.', '2004-06-08 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754447, 81053, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool, I''ve gotten the same effect where the moon is double exposed like that.  Doesn''t really fit the challenge well, but neat anyway. :)</td>', 'Cool, I''ve gotten the same effect where the moon is double exposed like that.  Doesn''t really fit the challenge well, but neat anyway. :)', '2004-06-08 01:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754453, 81622, 11793, '<td valign="top">flat<br/> <br/></td>', 'flat ', '2004-06-08 01:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(754456, 81817, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love the angled lighting on this.</td>', 'Love the angled lighting on this.', '2004-06-08 01:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754459, 81825, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty dramatic but it doesn''t display deep dof very well.  There is nothing in the foreground that is in focus (as far as I can tell).</td>', 'Pretty dramatic but it doesn''t display deep dof very well.  There is nothing in the foreground that is in focus (as far as I can tell).', '2004-06-08 01:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754462, 81930, 4494, '<td valign="top">OMG, I can''t see how ppl can stand this close "to the edge".   Scares me just looking at this. :)</td>', 'OMG, I can''t see how ppl can stand this close "to the edge".   Scares me just looking at this. :)', '2004-06-08 01:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(754470, 81921, 4494, '<td valign="top">It looks like BOTH the foreground and background candies are out of focus!  LOL.</td>', 'It looks like BOTH the foreground and background candies are out of focus!  LOL.', '2004-06-08 01:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(754471, 81289, 10673, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely beautiful!</td>', 'Exquisitely beautiful!', '2004-06-08 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(754475, 81872, 10673, '<td valign="top">Magnificently captured!  10</td>', 'Magnificently captured!  10', '2004-06-08 01:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(754477, 81915, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, what the... ?!!!   You must be a Photoshop expert? ;)</td>', 'LOL, what the... ?!!!   You must be a Photoshop expert? ;)', '2004-06-08 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(754480, 81128, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good idea...  The contrast on the landscape is a little low, but the sillouette is great.</td>', 'Good idea...  The contrast on the landscape is a little low, but the sillouette is great.', '2004-06-08 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(754484, 81902, 4494, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, this one is awesome.  I may be in trouble.  I would have used a different Title probably, "mother and son" just doesn''t sound right.  But the pic is great. :)</td>', 'Uh oh, this one is awesome.  I may be in trouble.  I would have used a different Title probably, "mother and son" just doesn''t sound right.  But the pic is great. :)', '2004-06-08 01:42:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(754487, 81501, 4494, '<td valign="top">Colors seem too over staturated.</td>', 'Colors seem too over staturated.', '2004-06-08 01:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(754497, 81243, 19608, '<td valign="top">It certainly meets the challenge, is well exposed, and well rendered.  I must admit the composition does nothing for me.  The tank, right on the edge, is a bad choice.</td>', 'It certainly meets the challenge, is well exposed, and well rendered.  I must admit the composition does nothing for me.  The tank, right on the edge, is a bad choice.', '2004-06-08 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(754501, 81697, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aha - someone who does understand deep DoF (a few don''t seem to.)  A very nice composition, great sky, nice colors.  It''s too bad there were two water towers merging in the background.  I would have though your shutter speed at that aperture would have made the water more velvety looking.</td>', 'Aha - someone who does understand deep DoF (a few don''t seem to.)  A very nice composition, great sky, nice colors.  It''s too bad there were two water towers merging in the background.  I would have though your shutter speed at that aperture would have made the water more velvety looking.', '2004-06-08 01:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754502, 80939, 22083, '<td valign="top">Very nice perpsective, too bad those lights are there which there is nothing you can do about, but it would have been perfect if not for thier distraction</td>', 'Very nice perpsective, too bad those lights are there which there is nothing you can do about, but it would have been perfect if not for thier distraction', '2004-06-08 01:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754504, 81528, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Someone who understands deep DoF!  Nice compostion, exposure and focus.  I might suggest cropping out about half of the sky.  All in all - a pleasant and strong submission.</td>', 'Excellent!  Someone who understands deep DoF!  Nice compostion, exposure and focus.  I might suggest cropping out about half of the sky.  All in all - a pleasant and strong submission.', '2004-06-08 01:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(754507, 81539, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice action shot - but the subject is a bit close to the right edge. DoF is good - but would be even better if something were in sharp focus closer to the lens.</td>', 'It''s a nice action shot - but the subject is a bit close to the right edge. DoF is good - but would be even better if something were in sharp focus closer to the lens.', '2004-06-08 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(754509, 81801, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing scene, well exposed.  Somehow it doesn''t quite feel right as a sepia - with that much water.</td>', 'A very pleasing scene, well exposed.  Somehow it doesn''t quite feel right as a sepia - with that much water.', '2004-06-08 01:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(754511, 81708, 11457, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, almost Escher-like. 10.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, almost Escher-like. 10.', '2004-06-08 01:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(754515, 81965, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great way to demonstrate DoF.  Nicely composed - but I wish you''d left out most (or all) of that terrible sky.  Colors a bit saturated - which works very well.  MAke it really zing with a train waaay at the other end.</td>', 'A great way to demonstrate DoF.  Nicely composed - but I wish you''d left out most (or all) of that terrible sky.  Colors a bit saturated - which works very well.  MAke it really zing with a train waaay at the other end.', '2004-06-08 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(754519, 81758, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent way to show DoF.  Try taking out the sky and it makes it more interesting - then it looks like railroad tracks, but suspended in the air!<br/>Excellent composition, exposure and rendering.</td>', 'Excellent way to show DoF.  Try taking out the sky and it makes it more interesting - then it looks like railroad tracks, but suspended in the air!Excellent composition, exposure and rendering.', '2004-06-08 02:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754520, 81832, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good subject (yummy), and good lighting.  But unfortunatly a very shallow DoF.</td>', 'Nice composition, good subject (yummy), and good lighting.  But unfortunatly a very shallow DoF.', '2004-06-08 02:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754521, 81557, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should be tilted to the left a couple degrees.  The building itself is great.  A lot of noise in the clouds and sky however.</td>', 'Should be tilted to the left a couple degrees.  The building itself is great.  A lot of noise in the clouds and sky however.', '2004-06-08 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(754523, 81660, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing - nice shutter speed to cature the water.</td>', 'Very pleasing - nice shutter speed to cature the water.', '2004-06-08 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(754528, 81574, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the colors and contrast is really off.  The pic looks very "flat" to me.  Try using Levels or Curves to improve this.</td>', 'Good idea but the colors and contrast is really off.  The pic looks very "flat" to me.  Try using Levels or Curves to improve this.', '2004-06-08 02:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(754534, 81837, 8054, '<td valign="top">Although a very impressive pattern, the focus seems to be off on the very outermost parts.</td>', 'Although a very impressive pattern, the focus seems to be off on the very outermost parts.', '2004-06-08 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(754536, 80603, 8054, '<td valign="top">As much as I love VWs (I own one myself) I must deduct brownie points because the roofline of the building is not even and the frame/border is a bit distracting. However, the amount of details of the Golf and of the farthest building are nice and clear. Contrast/saturation is very good, as well. I give you a 7.<br/> <br/>On a side note, do you visit vortex at all?</td>', 'As much as I love VWs (I own one myself) I must deduct brownie points because the roofline of the building is not even and the frame/border is a bit distracting. However, the amount of details of the Golf and of the farthest building are nice and clear. Contrast/saturation is very good, as well. I give you a 7. On a side note, do you visit vortex at all?', '2004-06-08 02:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(754538, 81187, 8054, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened and color balance seems a bit off. Lighting is also bright. The girl in the foreground looks like she was placed there just to provide a foreground focus point and not natural. Would look better if she had some interaction with another child to justify her position in the foreground.</td>', 'Oversharpened and color balance seems a bit off. Lighting is also bright. The girl in the foreground looks like she was placed there just to provide a foreground focus point and not natural. Would look better if she had some interaction with another child to justify her position in the foreground.', '2004-06-08 02:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(754540, 81650, 8054, '<td valign="top">Although hard to see details due to sheer distance, I''m assuming that the planes are in focus and giving you the benefit of the doubt. The foreground details have a feel about them that I just can''t figure out. They look like highly detailed CGI output but I know they are not but they just have that feel about them. Very good interpretation of the challenge. 7</td>', 'Although hard to see details due to sheer distance, I''m assuming that the planes are in focus and giving you the benefit of the doubt. The foreground details have a feel about them that I just can''t figure out. They look like highly detailed CGI output but I know they are not but they just have that feel about them. Very good interpretation of the challenge. 7', '2004-06-08 02:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(754541, 81818, 8054, '<td valign="top">Some noise throughout the photo and focus seems just a tad off on the boat and considerably more on the buildings in the background.</td>', 'Some noise throughout the photo and focus seems just a tad off on the boat and considerably more on the buildings in the background.', '2004-06-08 02:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
