(754587, 81426, 20235, '<td valign="top">What a great photo! Very dramatic subject and the color desaturations really emphasize this. Detail and DOF are excellent.... 8</td>', 'What a great photo! Very dramatic subject and the color desaturations really emphasize this. Detail and DOF are excellent.... 8', '2004-06-08 03:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(754588, 81747, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because of the subject and composition IMHO. I think it would have been better if the birds made up more of the composition and were zoomed closer, even if that meant losing some of the balloons in the shot.  This would have brought out more detail in the birds and emphasized the deep DOF.</td>', 'I like this photo because of the subject and composition IMHO. I think it would have been better if the birds made up more of the composition and were zoomed closer, even if that meant losing some of the balloons in the shot.  This would have brought out more detail in the birds and emphasized the deep DOF.', '2004-06-08 03:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754589, 81773, 20235, '<td valign="top">The composition, b&amp;w, and subject make this very dramatic. I like the shutter speed used to freeze the waves and splashes... really emphasizes the title. I give an 8</td>', 'The composition, b&w, and subject make this very dramatic. I like the shutter speed used to freeze the waves and splashes... really emphasizes the title. I give an 8', '2004-06-08 03:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(754590, 81584, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good point of view and use of lines and angles. IMHO I think a slower shutter speed to expose more detail and emphasize the motion of the people may have helped? Also, the part of the ledge/railing on the bottom left is somewhat distracting. Nice picture nonetheless.</td>', 'Good point of view and use of lines and angles. IMHO I think a slower shutter speed to expose more detail and emphasize the motion of the people may have helped? Also, the part of the ledge/railing on the bottom left is somewhat distracting. Nice picture nonetheless.', '2004-06-08 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(754591, 81837, 20235, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at, but I like it ;) Composition and detail are excellent. I also like your take on the challenge theme.... 8</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at, but I like it ;) Composition and detail are excellent. I also like your take on the challenge theme.... 8', '2004-06-08 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(754592, 81902, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great focus on both horses, they really look beautiful. Great burning too. 9<br/> <br/>Good luck :)</td>', 'Great focus on both horses, they really look beautiful. Great burning too. 9 Good luck :)', '2004-06-08 03:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754594, 81187, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and great detail on the castle. The textures of the stones and forest are quite apparent. White balance seems slightly off with the colors looking a little washed out. Polarizer filter to help maybe?</td>', 'Nice picture and great detail on the castle. The textures of the stones and forest are quite apparent. White balance seems slightly off with the colors looking a little washed out. Polarizer filter to help maybe?', '2004-06-08 03:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(754595, 81953, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great composition and vanishing point. The only thing that distracted me was the horizon looks slightly skewed CCW and the color pallete seems to be lacking in blue/green saturation.</td>', 'Great composition and vanishing point. The only thing that distracted me was the horizon looks slightly skewed CCW and the color pallete seems to be lacking in blue/green saturation.', '2004-06-08 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(754596, 81524, 20235, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture! The detail and colors are exquisite. Composition and deep DOF are great too.  My favorite shot so far....9</td>', 'Amazing picture! The detail and colors are exquisite. Composition and deep DOF are great too.  My favorite shot so far....9', '2004-06-08 04:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(754599, 81627, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shapes and textures throughout. The detail in the foliage and clouds is fantastic. The only thing I found distracting in this shot is the apparent graininess, especially in the sky.</td>', 'Great shapes and textures throughout. The detail in the foliage and clouds is fantastic. The only thing I found distracting in this shot is the apparent graininess, especially in the sky.', '2004-06-08 04:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754600, 80694, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good angle and detail. I think the photo would have been better if the sky was more dramatic as shapes and detail are lost in high-altitude cirrus clouds like the ones shown here.</td>', 'Good angle and detail. I think the photo would have been better if the sky was more dramatic as shapes and detail are lost in high-altitude cirrus clouds like the ones shown here.', '2004-06-08 04:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(754601, 81919, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition, detail, and deep DOF. The b&amp;w doesn''t work for me, but great photo nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Good composition, detail, and deep DOF. The b&w doesn''t work for me, but great photo nonetheless.... 7', '2004-06-08 04:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(754602, 81650, 20235, '<td valign="top">As an aviation buff, this picture scores brownie points with me ;)<br/>I like the detail on the tower''s gauges and binoculars where even the scraches are visible. Color tone and composition is good also. However, the DOF doe not appear as deep as it should be with the aircraft appearing blurry and lacking detail. But nice picture nonetheless.</td>', 'As an aviation buff, this picture scores brownie points with me ;)I like the detail on the tower''s gauges and binoculars where even the scraches are visible. Color tone and composition is good also. However, the DOF doe not appear as deep as it should be with the aircraft appearing blurry and lacking detail. But nice picture nonetheless.', '2004-06-08 04:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(754604, 81906, 20235, '<td valign="top">Haha, I have some of the same views of the Getty center in my portfolio ;)<br/>Having stood in the same spot as you looking over LA, I know first hand how the smoggy air can rob detail. Given that fact, this shot still does a good job bringing out the deep DOF and detail from the plants in the foreground, to the cars on the 495 freeway. Nice work, I give a 7</td>', 'Haha, I have some of the same views of the Getty center in my portfolio ;)Having stood in the same spot as you looking over LA, I know first hand how the smoggy air can rob detail. Given that fact, this shot still does a good job bringing out the deep DOF and detail from the plants in the foreground, to the cars on the 495 freeway. Nice work, I give a 7', '2004-06-08 04:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(754606, 81723, 20235, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought when I clicked this picture was "whoa". This is a beautiful photo. It perfectly captures the challenge theme and the DOF is great. Composition and detail are excellent and the low POV works well.... 9</td>', 'The first thing I thought when I clicked this picture was "whoa". This is a beautiful photo. It perfectly captures the challenge theme and the DOF is great. Composition and detail are excellent and the low POV works well.... 9', '2004-06-08 04:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(754608, 81493, 20235, '<td valign="top">I spent a good 5 min just looking at this photo. The different textures, colors, details, and layers is fantastic. Hope you do well, I give an 8</td>', 'I spent a good 5 min just looking at this photo. The different textures, colors, details, and layers is fantastic. Hope you do well, I give an 8', '2004-06-08 04:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(754609, 81957, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. The setup and composition of the shot look perfect.  DOF, detail, and lighting is great. Hope you do well, I give a 9</td>', 'Very cool photo. The setup and composition of the shot look perfect.  DOF, detail, and lighting is great. Hope you do well, I give a 9', '2004-06-08 04:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(754612, 81008, 19134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture! I love the jet engine visual.</td>', 'Beautiful picture! I love the jet engine visual.', '2004-06-08 04:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(754624, 81069, 22597, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing composition and colors! You had certainly succeed in capturing the deep deep of field ;-) Good luck in the contest!<br/></td>', 'Absolutely amazing composition and colors! You had certainly succeed in capturing the deep deep of field ;-) Good luck in the contest!', '2004-06-08 05:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(754644, 81394, 6630, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge, but IMHO, the pillar on the left does not add to the picture, in fact, I think it really takes away from it.</td>', 'This meets the challenge, but IMHO, the pillar on the left does not add to the picture, in fact, I think it really takes away from it.', '2004-06-08 06:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(754645, 80826, 6630, '<td valign="top">This is shallow DOF</td>', 'This is shallow DOF', '2004-06-08 06:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(754662, 81668, 16970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth and wonderful colours...  The green I so rich...  You must have risked your life for that shot ;)  (10)</td>', 'Beautiful depth and wonderful colours...  The green I so rich...  You must have risked your life for that shot ;)  (10)', '2004-06-08 07:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(754664, 81790, 6999, '<td valign="top">A middle ground image, I would think: the areas of over-exposure in the sky, the messy skyline, and the right-hand kid''s arm over his face will all get marked down I would think. For me, somehow the dof doesn''t actual add to the shot - it isn''t a fundamental part of the composition: imagine, if the background were out of focus, would it make a great difference to the composition? Not to my mind (the goalposts aren''t a significant enough element - the football tells us what''s been going on). It has an unprocessed look, and I think it cries out for more work - to lighten the faces, darken the clouds, add some depth and impact to the figures. Also, for me, the colour detracts from the image, taking the eye where it might be better to concentrate on shapes rather than colours</td>', 'A middle ground image, I would think: the areas of over-exposure in the sky, the messy skyline, and the right-hand kid''s arm over his face will all get marked down I would think. For me, somehow the dof doesn''t actual add to the shot - it isn''t a fundamental part of the composition: imagine, if the background were out of focus, would it make a great difference to the composition? Not to my mind (the goalposts aren''t a significant enough element - the football tells us what''s been going on). It has an unprocessed look, and I think it cries out for more work - to lighten the faces, darken the clouds, add some depth and impact to the figures. Also, for me, the colour detracts from the image, taking the eye where it might be better to concentrate on shapes rather than colours', '2004-06-08 07:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(754668, 80655, 19035, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, in my top 10.</td>', 'Beautifully done, in my top 10.', '2004-06-08 07:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754669, 81799, 19035, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but still a great shot - I give you a 7.</td>', 'A little grainy, but still a great shot - I give you a 7.', '2004-06-08 07:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(754671, 81072, 19035, '<td valign="top">The green in this photo is amazing, nicely done - in my top 10.</td>', 'The green in this photo is amazing, nicely done - in my top 10.', '2004-06-08 07:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(754672, 81711, 19035, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo - I really love it.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo - I really love it.', '2004-06-08 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(754674, 81627, 22604, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2004-06-08 07:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(754678, 81606, 18644, '<td valign="top">High ranking picture for me. After the challenges is over. I would try to put that window the same color as the rest. That picture is great.</td>', 'High ranking picture for me. After the challenges is over. I would try to put that window the same color as the rest. That picture is great.', '2004-06-08 07:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(754682, 81714, 6999, '<td valign="top">There seem to be a few of these bright light shots this week. It''s my major sticking point with this image - that quality of light. The shadows are very harsh, that difference between light and shade is heavy. The sky, whilst better than simply blue, is not particularly interesting, and there''s noise on those clouds. It also suffers from being a head-high shot, for me: you haven''t allowed your subject to impose itself on the composition. It could happily have been colour-shifted a touch toward warmer tones (this is really quite cold), and seems tilted (whether or not it actually is, it has that feeling). Technically, in the sense of focus and exposure, it''s fine: it''s just a poor subject, and not well framed or presented. 4</td>', 'There seem to be a few of these bright light shots this week. It''s my major sticking point with this image - that quality of light. The shadows are very harsh, that difference between light and shade is heavy. The sky, whilst better than simply blue, is not particularly interesting, and there''s noise on those clouds. It also suffers from being a head-high shot, for me: you haven''t allowed your subject to impose itself on the composition. It could happily have been colour-shifted a touch toward warmer tones (this is really quite cold), and seems tilted (whether or not it actually is, it has that feeling). Technically, in the sense of focus and exposure, it''s fine: it''s just a poor subject, and not well framed or presented. 4', '2004-06-08 07:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(754685, 81923, 22604, '<td valign="top">Exceptional DOF!</td>', 'Exceptional DOF!', '2004-06-08 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(754688, 81455, 6999, '<td valign="top">As I see this, the trees on the left lack some definition, and I think that hurts the image - the excellent toning of those on the right is unbalanced by it. Good clouds, good reflections, and I like the foreground log-thing, although i might have wanted more definition there too. Ultimately, I think the composition isn''t great - what you seem to have captured is the surroundings of an empty space: my eye is drawn constantly to the join of that right hand stand of trees and those on the far side of the lake, and there isn''t that much there to hold interest, to focus the eye. The bright part of the clouds pulls the eye, and you end up wandering through the image, with no point to hold the attention. Strong efffort, nontheless. 7</td>', 'As I see this, the trees on the left lack some definition, and I think that hurts the image - the excellent toning of those on the right is unbalanced by it. Good clouds, good reflections, and I like the foreground log-thing, although i might have wanted more definition there too. Ultimately, I think the composition isn''t great - what you seem to have captured is the surroundings of an empty space: my eye is drawn constantly to the join of that right hand stand of trees and those on the far side of the lake, and there isn''t that much there to hold interest, to focus the eye. The bright part of the clouds pulls the eye, and you end up wandering through the image, with no point to hold the attention. Strong efffort, nontheless. 7', '2004-06-08 07:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(754693, 81921, 6999, '<td valign="top">To my eye, your lighting lets you down here, both in the progression of brightness from foreground to background, and in those shadpws. I personally would at least have started by backlighting the set-up, and working from there to fill in shadows, but this seems like a single flash lightsource, or at any rate too close to the camera''s perspective. The depth of field also isn''t really that great - it may actually be so, but the inclusion of areas beyond what I''d call acceptable sharpness actually only serves to emphasise the limits of focus, rather than the depth of it. 4</td>', 'To my eye, your lighting lets you down here, both in the progression of brightness from foreground to background, and in those shadpws. I personally would at least have started by backlighting the set-up, and working from there to fill in shadows, but this seems like a single flash lightsource, or at any rate too close to the camera''s perspective. The depth of field also isn''t really that great - it may actually be so, but the inclusion of areas beyond what I''d call acceptable sharpness actually only serves to emphasise the limits of focus, rather than the depth of it. 4', '2004-06-08 07:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(754697, 81935, 6999, '<td valign="top">Dang it must be summer everywhere - all these bright daylight shots :-) <br/>I''m not convinced by this: you seem to me to have fallen between focussing on the figures closely enough to give a sense of their precariousness, or widely enough to give a sense of their scale. The light doesn''t help you - the strong shadows only help them to lend into the patterns of the background, and the larger shapes of the arches and the patterns of moulding rather overwhelm the image for me. I can''t see a rationale for the cropping, either, nor the framing of these figures. 5</td>', 'Dang it must be summer everywhere - all these bright daylight shots :-) I''m not convinced by this: you seem to me to have fallen between focussing on the figures closely enough to give a sense of their precariousness, or widely enough to give a sense of their scale. The light doesn''t help you - the strong shadows only help them to lend into the patterns of the background, and the larger shapes of the arches and the patterns of moulding rather overwhelm the image for me. I can''t see a rationale for the cropping, either, nor the framing of these figures. 5', '2004-06-08 08:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(754699, 80826, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, outside of challenge specs however. Not completely sure about tthe composition, either - those white-flowered bushes frame right ... 2</td>', 'Interesting image, outside of challenge specs however. Not completely sure about tthe composition, either - those white-flowered bushes frame right ... 2', '2004-06-08 08:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(754702, 81807, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, a competent image at last. Good detailing, good tonal work, perhaps a pity the swans weren''t a touch more organised for you. Even beyond the challenge idea, I think it lacks foreground elements - oh for a swan to wander closer to camera. 6</td>', 'Ah, a competent image at last. Good detailing, good tonal work, perhaps a pity the swans weren''t a touch more organised for you. Even beyond the challenge idea, I think it lacks foreground elements - oh for a swan to wander closer to camera. 6', '2004-06-08 08:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(754704, 81902, 6999, '<td valign="top">I rather think folks will like this. I find the dodging and burning a bit ... well, sickly, really: over-egging the pudding, for me. Definition and toning on the lighter grey horse/pony is excellent, but aking the sky so close to black, and the fake-looking darkening of the grass, and a sense of lightening in the sky around the faces all comes across to me as taking things too far. wouldn''t be at all surprised to see it win. 6</td>', 'I rather think folks will like this. I find the dodging and burning a bit ... well, sickly, really: over-egging the pudding, for me. Definition and toning on the lighter grey horse/pony is excellent, but aking the sky so close to black, and the fake-looking darkening of the grass, and a sense of lightening in the sky around the faces all comes across to me as taking things too far. wouldn''t be at all surprised to see it win. 6', '2004-06-08 08:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(754705, 81501, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa, enough with the colour processing! There''s a distinct impression that there may have been a wonderful range of tones in the trees here, but the oversaturation of the nearground greens, and the bizarre turquise of the sky really distract me from seeing that. 5</td>', 'Whoa, enough with the colour processing! There''s a distinct impression that there may have been a wonderful range of tones in the trees here, but the oversaturation of the nearground greens, and the bizarre turquise of the sky really distract me from seeing that. 5', '2004-06-08 08:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(754731, 80457, 16126, '<td valign="top">I think this is not a good demonstration of deep DOF, only of a far away focus point. Nice picture though.</td>', 'I think this is not a good demonstration of deep DOF, only of a far away focus point. Nice picture though.', '2004-06-08 09:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(754732, 81584, 16126, '<td valign="top">V&amp;D in Utrecht?</td>', 'V&D in Utrecht?', '2004-06-08 09:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(754735, 81591, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the colors. I would have liked to have the horizon off-center to make the composition more interesting. 8</td>', 'Very nice capture of the colors. I would have liked to have the horizon off-center to make the composition more interesting. 8', '2004-06-08 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(754736, 81717, 16126, '<td valign="top">For a deep DOF, the window should have been in focus. I think the composition could have been more interesting by having less wall framing the view.</td>', 'For a deep DOF, the window should have been in focus. I think the composition could have been more interesting by having less wall framing the view.', '2004-06-08 09:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(754770, 81533, 15129, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would have rated it higher except for the hot spots on the flowers.</td>', 'Nice. I would have rated it higher except for the hot spots on the flowers.', '2004-06-08 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(754772, 80655, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very impressive for its sharpness and composition. Good luck.</td>', 'Very impressive for its sharpness and composition. Good luck.', '2004-06-08 10:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(754773, 81758, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very strong. Everything works--converging lines, reflections, exposure, etc. Good luck.</td>', 'Very strong. Everything works--converging lines, reflections, exposure, etc. Good luck.', '2004-06-08 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
