(755390, 81112, 11518, '<td valign="top">Hardly deep DOF...not the best subject for this challenge.</td>', 'Hardly deep DOF...not the best subject for this challenge.', '2004-06-08 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(755393, 81808, 11518, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry...</td>', 'Kinda blurry...', '2004-06-08 19:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(755401, 80655, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, great DOF. 10</td>', 'Very nice shot, great DOF. 10', '2004-06-08 19:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(755402, 81472, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice skyline but does not really show a deep DOF. 6</td>', 'Nice skyline but does not really show a deep DOF. 6', '2004-06-08 19:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(755408, 81684, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot, tough to get a really deep DOF with these, but you managed to do quite well!  I like this photo but some people might vote it down because the DOF is not very deep. 7</td>', 'Great macro shot, tough to get a really deep DOF with these, but you managed to do quite well!  I like this photo but some people might vote it down because the DOF is not very deep. 7', '2004-06-08 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(755410, 81528, 20992, '<td valign="top">ooh I LOVE this one!!! The sky could have been just a little more threathening to add even more drama to the picture, but it''s also ok now!<br/>Your colours are realistic, though strong, your compostion is great, that little bush in the background really confirms your deep DOF..this must be a winner''s photo!!</td>', 'ooh I LOVE this one!!! The sky could have been just a little more threathening to add even more drama to the picture, but it''s also ok now!Your colours are realistic, though strong, your compostion is great, that little bush in the background really confirms your deep DOF..this must be a winner''s photo!!', '2004-06-08 19:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(755412, 81660, 11518, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite show deep DOF.  You need a foreground element to give a sense of distance.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite show deep DOF.  You need a foreground element to give a sense of distance.  Nice shot though.', '2004-06-08 19:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(755416, 81921, 20992, '<td valign="top">nice idea! (did you eat them all afterwards?)<br/>I like the graduate use of light, the back is much more dark than the front, adding even more depth in this picture. Too bad that not all marshmellows are in focus though...</td>', 'nice idea! (did you eat them all afterwards?)I like the graduate use of light, the back is much more dark than the front, adding even more depth in this picture. Too bad that not all marshmellows are in focus though...', '2004-06-08 19:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(755417, 81956, 11518, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, the haze in the background makes you lose the Deep DOF.  A graduated neutral density filter would have helped here.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, the haze in the background makes you lose the Deep DOF.  A graduated neutral density filter would have helped here.', '2004-06-08 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(755418, 81801, 11518, '<td valign="top">A tad out of focus.</td>', 'A tad out of focus.', '2004-06-08 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(755420, 81911, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. 8</td>', 'Beautiful. 8', '2004-06-08 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(755422, 81528, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, you could have increased the sense of depth even more by shooting from a little stool. 8</td>', 'Beautiful, you could have increased the sense of depth even more by shooting from a little stool. 8', '2004-06-08 19:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(755424, 81806, 20992, '<td valign="top">The drama!!! (I also think I know who''s pictures this is, because that certain one from Iceland has a specific own style :) ) Great sky, great colours! Did you backlight this one?? Or is it pure nature.... Lovely shot!</td>', 'The drama!!! (I also think I know who''s pictures this is, because that certain one from Iceland has a specific own style :) ) Great sky, great colours! Did you backlight this one?? Or is it pure nature.... Lovely shot!', '2004-06-08 19:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(755426, 81606, 16509, '<td valign="top">Remember 911.</td>', 'Remember 911.', '2004-06-08 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(755427, 81524, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, a more prominent foreground element would have increased the depth even more. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot, a more prominent foreground element would have increased the depth even more. 8', '2004-06-08 19:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(755433, 81953, 20992, '<td valign="top">serene, peaceful, lovely balanced composition, beautiful subtle colouring, (why isn''t that horizon straigt?? that''s the only thing..but that won''t keep me from scoring a 10!!)</td>', 'serene, peaceful, lovely balanced composition, beautiful subtle colouring, (why isn''t that horizon straigt?? that''s the only thing..but that won''t keep me from scoring a 10!!)', '2004-06-08 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(755441, 81531, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very good!  You sure put a lot of effort to get that pic...scaling up that rock...</td>', 'Very good!  You sure put a lot of effort to get that pic...scaling up that rock...', '2004-06-08 19:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(755444, 81822, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, well done. 10</td>', 'Beautiful, well done. 10', '2004-06-08 19:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(755446, 80826, 11518, '<td valign="top">This does NOT show deep DOF, it shows the opposite.  If the trees were in focus then it would have fitted the challenge.</td>', 'This does NOT show deep DOF, it shows the opposite.  If the trees were in focus then it would have fitted the challenge.', '2004-06-08 19:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(755449, 81832, 11518, '<td valign="top">uh this is Shallow DOF.</td>', 'uh this is Shallow DOF.', '2004-06-08 19:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(755451, 81507, 11518, '<td valign="top">This is Shallow DOF.</td>', 'This is Shallow DOF.', '2004-06-08 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(755452, 81902, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot Heida, great burning too.</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot Heida, great burning too.', '2004-06-08 19:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(755453, 81727, 20992, '<td valign="top">This photo is probably already been put up for disqualification already. I''m really amazed with this and, at first sight, can''t believe this can be done without cheating...The moon that big and in focus AND the very small animal in front in focus together...If it is genuine, I really think this should win! I voted a 10</td>', 'This photo is probably already been put up for disqualification already. I''m really amazed with this and, at first sight, can''t believe this can be done without cheating...The moon that big and in focus AND the very small animal in front in focus together...If it is genuine, I really think this should win! I voted a 10', '2004-06-08 19:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(755461, 81957, 11518, '<td valign="top">LMAO, very imaginative and very well executed. 10</td>', 'LMAO, very imaginative and very well executed. 10', '2004-06-08 19:50:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(755462, 80457, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but this does not show Deep DOF</td>', 'Nice shot but this does not show Deep DOF', '2004-06-08 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(755467, 81298, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crisp picture.  Love those reflections. 10</td>', 'Beautiful crisp picture.  Love those reflections. 10', '2004-06-08 19:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(755476, 81591, 18349, '<td valign="top">This was exactly what I wanted to do but we had such bad weather all week I couldn''t get any of my shots to turn out with the colors I wanted.  You did it beautifully!  Great minds think alike, you know!  ;o)</td>', 'This was exactly what I wanted to do but we had such bad weather all week I couldn''t get any of my shots to turn out with the colors I wanted.  You did it beautifully!  Great minds think alike, you know!  ;o)', '2004-06-08 20:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(755478, 81651, 15403, '<td valign="top">I love what you''ve done here.  The yellow/green/blue/white makes a dazzling photo.</td>', 'I love what you''ve done here.  The yellow/green/blue/white makes a dazzling photo.', '2004-06-08 20:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(755479, 81271, 15403, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous.  Your lighting is perfect</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous.  Your lighting is perfect', '2004-06-08 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(755480, 81736, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit heavy on the NI...lots of detail is lost.  Great idea and lighting.</td>', 'I think it''s a bit heavy on the NI...lots of detail is lost.  Great idea and lighting.', '2004-06-08 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(755482, 81053, 18349, '<td valign="top">God bless you and God bless me!  Very nice colors in your shot. :o)</td>', 'God bless you and God bless me!  Very nice colors in your shot. :o)', '2004-06-08 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(755483, 81822, 15403, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I wonder if you were to take this shot again on a perfectly clear day, how it would look?  I''d love to see it.</td>', 'Nice job.  I wonder if you were to take this shot again on a perfectly clear day, how it would look?  I''d love to see it.', '2004-06-08 20:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(755484, 81953, 15403, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Fits perfectly into the challenge (the way I understand deep DOF).  This will be a beautiful print</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Fits perfectly into the challenge (the way I understand deep DOF).  This will be a beautiful print', '2004-06-08 20:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(755485, 81455, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simply breathtaking...I am in awe. :o)</td>', 'Simply breathtaking...I am in awe. :o)', '2004-06-08 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(755486, 81312, 18349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and detail! :o)</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and detail! :o)', '2004-06-08 20:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(755488, 81524, 15403, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  I wonder how this would look with a hint of blue sky in the background?</td>', 'beautiful.  I wonder how this would look with a hint of blue sky in the background?', '2004-06-08 20:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(755490, 81062, 18349, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the angle, but the fiery red is pretty.</td>', 'I don''t care for the angle, but the fiery red is pretty.', '2004-06-08 20:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(755492, 81825, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful; love the treatment you''ve given this shot.  Very dramatic.</td>', 'Very beautiful; love the treatment you''ve given this shot.  Very dramatic.', '2004-06-08 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(755493, 81170, 15403, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The shadowed right side is unfortunate, but uncontrollable.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The shadowed right side is unfortunate, but uncontrollable.', '2004-06-08 20:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(755494, 81501, 15403, '<td valign="top">striking colors.  I really like the "layered effect" that the various trees provide</td>', 'striking colors.  I really like the "layered effect" that the various trees provide', '2004-06-08 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(755496, 81936, 18349, '<td valign="top">One has to wonder how many unfortunate summer skaters have drowned prior to this sign being posted...what a shame!  ;o)<br/>Beautiful shot and nice reflection.  <br/></td>', 'One has to wonder how many unfortunate summer skaters have drowned prior to this sign being posted...what a shame!  ;o)Beautiful shot and nice reflection.  ', '2004-06-08 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(755499, 81557, 18349, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a scene out of Ghostbusters. :o)</td>', 'Reminds me of a scene out of Ghostbusters. :o)', '2004-06-08 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(755503, 81768, 18349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, excellent focus and details, but why the angle?  :o)</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, excellent focus and details, but why the angle?  :o)', '2004-06-08 20:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(755506, 81915, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''m confused, but that''s not unusual for me.  :o)</td>', 'I''m confused, but that''s not unusual for me.  :o)', '2004-06-08 20:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(755507, 81902, 18349, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph.  Very artistic and stylish.</td>', 'Stunning photograph.  Very artistic and stylish.', '2004-06-08 20:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(755510, 81821, 18349, '<td valign="top">Would love it except for that flower...too bright and harshly lit.  Horizon is tilted to the left.  The sky and ground alone would be a beautiful submission. :o)</td>', 'Would love it except for that flower...too bright and harshly lit.  Horizon is tilted to the left.  The sky and ground alone would be a beautiful submission. :o)', '2004-06-08 20:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(755516, 81372, 18349, '<td valign="top">I can hear the Michael Jackson and Bee Gees songs playing as we speak...ah, the memories... :o)</td>', 'I can hear the Michael Jackson and Bee Gees songs playing as we speak...ah, the memories... :o)', '2004-06-08 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(755518, 81956, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute, very clever title.  Pretty scene; appears a bit hazy on my monitor.</td>', 'Cute, very clever title.  Pretty scene; appears a bit hazy on my monitor.', '2004-06-08 20:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(755525, 81957, 17551, '<td valign="top">great idea, attractive model and good lighting (especially since chrome is not easy to light). 9</td>', 'great idea, attractive model and good lighting (especially since chrome is not easy to light). 9', '2004-06-08 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(755659, 81132, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful well composed shot, I love the reflections of the clouds in the water, nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful well composed shot, I love the reflections of the clouds in the water, nice work.', '2004-06-08 22:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(755664, 81591, 4793, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a beautiful shot, nice composition and colors are wonderful.</td>', 'Congratulations on a beautiful shot, nice composition and colors are wonderful.', '2004-06-08 22:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(755681, 81964, 5358, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  One of my fav''s from the contest.</td>', 'Great shot.  One of my fav''s from the contest.', '2004-06-08 22:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(755689, 81957, 5358, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe you had to validate this. Hopefully you haven''t got many weak votes.  Great shot.   Bump for creativity.</td>', 'Can''t believe you had to validate this. Hopefully you haven''t got many weak votes.  Great shot.   Bump for creativity.', '2004-06-08 22:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(755713, 81902, 18361, '<td valign="top">omg 10!</td>', 'omg 10!', '2004-06-08 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(755724, 81584, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very interesting way to capture DoF!   It''s also a study in triangles.</td>', 'A very interesting way to capture DoF!   It''s also a study in triangles.', '2004-06-08 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(755726, 81372, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in the skaters - gives it a good feel.  Lighting is very interesting as is the slit composition.  As far as deep DoF goes, you got a little close to the bannister at the bottom to make it really effective.</td>', 'I like the movement in the skaters - gives it a good feel.  Lighting is very interesting as is the slit composition.  As far as deep DoF goes, you got a little close to the bannister at the bottom to make it really effective.', '2004-06-08 23:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(755732, 81956, 19608, '<td valign="top">No - they are cows!  This is a techical gem - great composition, exposure and focus.  The paster-like colors are very pleasing.  Without something closer to the lens, it''s a bit weak for showing deep Dof - but I still like it!</td>', 'No - they are cows!  This is a techical gem - great composition, exposure and focus.  The paster-like colors are very pleasing.  Without something closer to the lens, it''s a bit weak for showing deep Dof - but I still like it!', '2004-06-08 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(755739, 81872, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - the classic "S" curve.  Great composition and exposure.  Make it better by add something on the path at the far end (model in a colored jacket?)</td>', 'Ah - the classic "S" curve.  Great composition and exposure.  Make it better by add something on the path at the far end (model in a colored jacket?)', '2004-06-08 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(755742, 81923, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very pastoral scene (pun intended.)  Nice subtle colors in a good composition.  Without something closer to the lens, it''s not really a good example of deep DoF.<br/></td>', 'A very pastoral scene (pun intended.)  Nice subtle colors in a good composition.  Without something closer to the lens, it''s not really a good example of deep DoF.', '2004-06-08 23:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(755744, 81953, 19608, '<td valign="top">Splendid - and someone who does indeed know how to demonstrate a deep DoF.  Nice composition and muted colors make this wwork very well.<br/></td>', 'Splendid - and someone who does indeed know how to demonstrate a deep DoF.  Nice composition and muted colors make this wwork very well.', '2004-06-08 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(755748, 81647, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice animal.  Too bad the lighting is so contrasty.  NOt really showing much DoF.</td>', 'A nice animal.  Too bad the lighting is so contrasty.  NOt really showing much DoF.', '2004-06-08 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(755759, 81921, 19608, '<td valign="top">Where''s the campfire?  Good repeating pattern - pastel colors make it work nicely. Focus falls off in the forground and far background - so it does show your entire "in focus" area.  I''m curious as to your lens and aperture selection.</td>', 'Where''s the campfire?  Good repeating pattern - pastel colors make it work nicely. Focus falls off in the forground and far background - so it does show your entire "in focus" area.  I''m curious as to your lens and aperture selection.', '2004-06-08 23:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(755767, 81957, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Great positioning of the crescent wrench - and using it as a tool to demonstrate DoF!  It''s also a perfect demonstration of multiple sources of light - exposure is perfect on the model and the prop.  Black background a real winner.  This should finish well above the pack.</td>', 'Ha!  Great positioning of the crescent wrench - and using it as a tool to demonstrate DoF!  It''s also a perfect demonstration of multiple sources of light - exposure is perfect on the model and the prop.  Black background a real winner.  This should finish well above the pack.', '2004-06-08 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(755768, 81930, 10818, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-14 18:51:42.</i></td>', '.', '2004-06-08 23:17:18.000000', '2004-06-14 19:51:42.000000', 1),
(755771, 81951, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful antique - nicely exposed and composed.  I''d like to say you satisfied the deep DoF, but.....</td>', 'Beautiful antique - nicely exposed and composed.  I''d like to say you satisfied the deep DoF, but.....', '2004-06-08 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(755774, 81949, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice city scene.  Colors a bit saturated but effective.  The white sky is a "bad."    You need something in the [closer] foreground to really demonstrate a deep Dof.</td>', 'A very nice city scene.  Colors a bit saturated but effective.  The white sky is a "bad."    You need something in the [closer] foreground to really demonstrate a deep Dof.', '2004-06-08 23:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(755778, 81937, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lovely stream.  Good exposure and adequate Dof for the challenge.  Try a slower shutter speed if you can - to make the water nice and velvety.  (It may take a neutral density filter to make it work right.)</td>', 'Lovely stream.  Good exposure and adequate Dof for the challenge.  Try a slower shutter speed if you can - to make the water nice and velvety.  (It may take a neutral density filter to make it work right.)', '2004-06-08 23:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(755780, 81682, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a very colorful balloon - in a nice composition.  I like the human figures providing scale. The white sky a bit detracting.  To show a deep Dof, it would be better if something were closer to the lens.</td>', 'It''s a very colorful balloon - in a nice composition.  I like the human figures providing scale. The white sky a bit detracting.  To show a deep Dof, it would be better if something were closer to the lens.', '2004-06-08 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(755809, 81788, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for the challenge. The title is a bit over done.</td>', 'Nice shot for the challenge. The title is a bit over done.', '2004-06-08 23:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(755810, 81946, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely camera/lighting work.</td>', 'Lovely camera/lighting work.', '2004-06-08 23:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(755814, 81902, 327, '<td valign="top">Shaggy beast! :0) I like this, good focus.</td>', 'Shaggy beast! :0) I like this, good focus.', '2004-06-08 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(755879, 81776, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a SUPERB view of the city at (sunrise/sunset) - great colors, great sky.  As far as deep DOF goes..... not.  But I still love it!</td>', 'This is a SUPERB view of the city at (sunrise/sunset) - great colors, great sky.  As far as deep DOF goes..... not.  But I still love it!', '2004-06-09 00:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(755885, 81806, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has a very dramatic mood.  Although a bit centered, it would be easy to crop off the left side  (about 1/2 of the distance from the edge to the model) to make it a perfect composition.  The lighting (or post processing) on the model''s shirt is superb.  Having said all that, it''s a bit weak on the deep DoF requirement, but I still think it''s a fantastic image.</td>', 'This image has a very dramatic mood.  Although a bit centered, it would be easy to crop off the left side  (about 1/2 of the distance from the edge to the model) to make it a perfect composition.  The lighting (or post processing) on the model''s shirt is superb.  Having said all that, it''s a bit weak on the deep DoF requirement, but I still think it''s a fantastic image.', '2004-06-09 00:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(755887, 81289, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image.  Stand by for a ribbon headed in your directiion.</td>', 'Exceptional image.  Stand by for a ribbon headed in your directiion.', '2004-06-09 00:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(755892, 81186, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a near perfect image that clearly demonstrates a deep DOF. Wonderful colors, composition and exposure.<br/> <br/>Then you tag on a title that says "forget this one" and a border that says "I''m better than the image."<br/> <br/>Even so,  it''s one of my top choices for ribbonland.</td>', 'You have a near perfect image that clearly demonstrates a deep DOF. Wonderful colors, composition and exposure. Then you tag on a title that says "forget this one" and a border that says "I''m better than the image." Even so,  it''s one of my top choices for ribbonland.', '2004-06-09 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(755897, 80789, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, exposure, and demonstration of deep DoF.  I would have added another point if the colors weren''t so unrealistically pumped up.</td>', 'This is a great composition, exposure, and demonstration of deep DoF.  I would have added another point if the colors weren''t so unrealistically pumped up.', '2004-06-09 00:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(756166, 81806, 17916, '<td valign="top">great shot, interesting lighting. I''d like to see subject more to the left, but still great.</td>', 'great shot, interesting lighting. I''d like to see subject more to the left, but still great.', '2004-06-09 02:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(756167, 81507, 17916, '<td valign="top">deep not shallow</td>', 'deep not shallow', '2004-06-09 02:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(756177, 81069, 17916, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very well composed, very painterly. Did you use the shadow/highlight filter? Or manually lighten up the foreground? I notice a bit of "glow" between  the sky and tree trunk upper left. Still great shot</td>', 'Great shot, very well composed, very painterly. Did you use the shadow/highlight filter? Or manually lighten up the foreground? I notice a bit of "glow" between  the sky and tree trunk upper left. Still great shot', '2004-06-09 02:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(756179, 81825, 17916, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-06-09 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(756180, 81915, 17916, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2004-06-09 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(756181, 81832, 17916, '<td valign="top">keyword, deep</td>', 'keyword, deep', '2004-06-09 02:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(756391, 80655, 7743, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge.  The clarity is excellent. 9</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge.  The clarity is excellent. 9', '2004-06-09 05:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(756392, 81455, 5358, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Was this completely adjusted in photoshop, or was it shot with a filter?  Almost looks infrared the way the sky is darkened and the white shrubbery.</td>', 'Great photo.  Was this completely adjusted in photoshop, or was it shot with a filter?  Almost looks infrared the way the sky is darkened and the white shrubbery.', '2004-06-09 05:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(756396, 81953, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like your use of the vanishing point here. The strong graphic elements of this shot cry out for a black and white treatment to my eye - then it becomes more about the shapes and less about the tones (though the grey-blue of sea and the muted browns of boards are a pleasant combination). The strength of this, though, for me, lies in the way the scene is precisely sectioned by those elements.  I think I would also have put some time in darkening sky and sea, which would give a stronger impact, as far as a challenge is concerned: whilst it repays looking, I don''t think that many people spend that long when voting. 6</td>', 'Like your use of the vanishing point here. The strong graphic elements of this shot cry out for a black and white treatment to my eye - then it becomes more about the shapes and less about the tones (though the grey-blue of sea and the muted browns of boards are a pleasant combination). The strength of this, though, for me, lies in the way the scene is precisely sectioned by those elements.  I think I would also have put some time in darkening sky and sea, which would give a stronger impact, as far as a challenge is concerned: whilst it repays looking, I don''t think that many people spend that long when voting. 6', '2004-06-09 05:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(756400, 81736, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is a marvellously lyrical shot of what is often so very humdrum and messy. You''ve turned it into some kind of balletic exercise in light. I particularly like the negative space (though I''m certain many people won''t understand the point of it). There''s that odd smooth quality - is this NI doing it''s more heavy work?, or some sort of channel-split gaussian blur? - but it''s everso effective in this case.  <br/> <br/>Obviously has no place in this challenge, unfortunately, and I''m sure you''ll have been told that already ... but a wonderful shot nevertheless.</td>', 'This is a marvellously lyrical shot of what is often so very humdrum and messy. You''ve turned it into some kind of balletic exercise in light. I particularly like the negative space (though I''m certain many people won''t understand the point of it). There''s that odd smooth quality - is this NI doing it''s more heavy work?, or some sort of channel-split gaussian blur? - but it''s everso effective in this case.   Obviously has no place in this challenge, unfortunately, and I''m sure you''ll have been told that already ... but a wonderful shot nevertheless.', '2004-06-09 05:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(756513, 81832, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oops. I''m not convinced about the shot anyway, leaving aside the challenge; it would seem to me that the variation in these shapes cries out exactly for a deep depth of field rather than this shallow one - had they been identical objects, and had you arranged them so that therre was more progression through the field of focus, then perhaps it would work. 3 - mainly for missing the challenge.</td>', 'Oops. I''m not convinced about the shot anyway, leaving aside the challenge; it would seem to me that the variation in these shapes cries out exactly for a deep depth of field rather than this shallow one - had they been identical objects, and had you arranged them so that therre was more progression through the field of focus, then perhaps it would work. 3 - mainly for missing the challenge.', '2004-06-09 08:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(756516, 81606, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not two? Like the idea of the shot, not completely happy with the execution - I think I would have tried to frame the plane further from the edge of image, to start with - it''s really too close to the edge for happiness for me. I like the processing, though I guess many won''t, although the very hard halo''s from sharpening I could live without. 6</td>', 'Not two? Like the idea of the shot, not completely happy with the execution - I think I would have tried to frame the plane further from the edge of image, to start with - it''s really too close to the edge for happiness for me. I like the processing, though I guess many won''t, although the very hard halo''s from sharpening I could live without. 6', '2004-06-09 08:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(756524, 81682, 6999, '<td valign="top">A lack of colour impact, for me - a white balance thing, perhaps? Fairly chaotic composition - the three overlapping figures add confusion, the cropping of the balloon ... if you''d got down at low level and shot to fame the person holding that rope entirely against the background of the balloon, for instance, you''d have a far stronger image. Including the background only on image left doesn''t really seem to add anything to this, especially when cropping out the otop and left of the balloon. 5</td>', 'A lack of colour impact, for me - a white balance thing, perhaps? Fairly chaotic composition - the three overlapping figures add confusion, the cropping of the balloon ... if you''d got down at low level and shot to fame the person holding that rope entirely against the background of the balloon, for instance, you''d have a far stronger image. Including the background only on image left doesn''t really seem to add anything to this, especially when cropping out the otop and left of the balloon. 5', '2004-06-09 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(756527, 81591, 8643, '<td valign="top">Just a tiny bit over sharpened for my taste.</td>', 'Just a tiny bit over sharpened for my taste.', '2004-06-09 08:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(756614, 81528, 6999, '<td valign="top">Without that tree, nothing.</td>', 'Without that tree, nothing.', '2004-06-09 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(756621, 81290, 6999, '<td valign="top">This has a real holiday snapshot feel to the exposure - fundamentally, and I don''t mean in the sense of pure technique, this is over-exposed. Obviously all the detail is there, and I''m sure a histogram will tell you otherwise, but this is over. There''s no sense of immediacy, no presence to it - all those colours and shapes have become so muted in the haze that definition has begun to go. It also suffers from the age old summer sunlight problem - really so unflattering on any landscape, so harsh. I see nice compositional ideas at work here however, which go some way to rescuing the shot ... but the blue-ing of everything, and the light ... 4</td>', 'This has a real holiday snapshot feel to the exposure - fundamentally, and I don''t mean in the sense of pure technique, this is over-exposed. Obviously all the detail is there, and I''m sure a histogram will tell you otherwise, but this is over. There''s no sense of immediacy, no presence to it - all those colours and shapes have become so muted in the haze that definition has begun to go. It also suffers from the age old summer sunlight problem - really so unflattering on any landscape, so harsh. I see nice compositional ideas at work here however, which go some way to rescuing the shot ... but the blue-ing of everything, and the light ... 4', '2004-06-09 10:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(756630, 81627, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very little definition in the green areas - possibly because of exaggerated sharpening? It''s become massively pixelated at the 1:1 resolution - there is no (or at least little) progression between pixels. Quite like the effect actually, though it seems in such contrast to the effect on the sky (I''m sure it''s the same thing, but its impact in different areas is weird). Two problems for this challenge: the effect seems more about processing than about photography, and it doesn''t strike as a deep dof image (though you aren''t losing marks for the latter - I just think you will from others). I like the blankness of the image, of the composition, but for my enthusiasm would like to see more gentlness to the work on the greenery. 7<br/> <br/>re-reading comment I haven''t mentioned how striking this image is. But I have now.</td>', 'Very little definition in the green areas - possibly because of exaggerated sharpening? It''s become massively pixelated at the 1:1 resolution - there is no (or at least little) progression between pixels. Quite like the effect actually, though it seems in such contrast to the effect on the sky (I''m sure it''s the same thing, but its impact in different areas is weird). Two problems for this challenge: the effect seems more about processing than about photography, and it doesn''t strike as a deep dof image (though you aren''t losing marks for the latter - I just think you will from others). I like the blankness of the image, of the composition, but for my enthusiasm would like to see more gentlness to the work on the greenery. 7 re-reading comment I haven''t mentioned how striking this image is. But I have now.', '2004-06-09 10:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(756642, 81655, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of this compositional technique, although i would personally try to bring the foreground at least into centre frame, if possible, or refrain. Would like to have seen a more interesting moment of light chosen for those stones'' sake - there must be enormous texture and variation there that would be amphasised by a different quality of light; this has that high contrast hallmark of midday-ish light, lacking subtlety. 5</td>', 'I''m a fan of this compositional technique, although i would personally try to bring the foreground at least into centre frame, if possible, or refrain. Would like to have seen a more interesting moment of light chosen for those stones'' sake - there must be enormous texture and variation there that would be amphasised by a different quality of light; this has that high contrast hallmark of midday-ish light, lacking subtlety. 5', '2004-06-09 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(756654, 81298, 6999, '<td valign="top">And, to extend your analogy, kind of flat, in an odd way. Clever work, though I have doubts about this being a useful subject for the challenge (which you''ve obviously met). We know the object has depth - but from experience, rather than from what you show. Good light, and tones, though some will find the reflections annoying on the bell - as much I would say because they look for problems rather than the constructive. Somehow, the bar-work on the stops is too confused to allow the simple graphical effect of perspective to function, I think, making the foreshortening much more drastic. A lot of stuff I like though. 7</td>', 'And, to extend your analogy, kind of flat, in an odd way. Clever work, though I have doubts about this being a useful subject for the challenge (which you''ve obviously met). We know the object has depth - but from experience, rather than from what you show. Good light, and tones, though some will find the reflections annoying on the bell - as much I would say because they look for problems rather than the constructive. Somehow, the bar-work on the stops is too confused to allow the simple graphical effect of perspective to function, I think, making the foreshortening much more drastic. A lot of stuff I like though. 7', '2004-06-09 10:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(756662, 81591, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yep. Meets challenge OK. Like the regularity of this - the composition suits the organisation of nature theme well, as does the cleanliness of the scene generally - nice trees, nice grass, nice tidy rolls of straw. Pretty good light, although the golden glow from shooting a bit later would take it completely into the bucolic, and perhaps add even more to the sentimental countryside feel. I can understand your cropping, with those clouds, but I nevertheless think you''ve included either too much or not enough sky for a really coherent balance of comsposition. 6</td>', 'Yep. Meets challenge OK. Like the regularity of this - the composition suits the organisation of nature theme well, as does the cleanliness of the scene generally - nice trees, nice grass, nice tidy rolls of straw. Pretty good light, although the golden glow from shooting a bit later would take it completely into the bucolic, and perhaps add even more to the sentimental countryside feel. I can understand your cropping, with those clouds, but I nevertheless think you''ve included either too much or not enough sky for a really coherent balance of comsposition. 6', '2004-06-09 10:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(756668, 81924, 6999, '<td valign="top">Sensational sky, but that''s about all. A feeling of tilt to the horizon, whether real or imagined, and at best an indistinctness of foreground doesn''t help with the challenge thing - there may well be extraordinaryily deep dof, but you haven''t really shown it. I would personally have tried to lighten some of the sky away from the sun - you already have the contrast with the brighter part, and the extreme top of frame seems to serve no useful purpose compositionally.</td>', 'Sensational sky, but that''s about all. A feeling of tilt to the horizon, whether real or imagined, and at best an indistinctness of foreground doesn''t help with the challenge thing - there may well be extraordinaryily deep dof, but you haven''t really shown it. I would personally have tried to lighten some of the sky away from the sun - you already have the contrast with the brighter part, and the extreme top of frame seems to serve no useful purpose compositionally.', '2004-06-09 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(756680, 81524, 6999, '<td valign="top">wonderful view - but oh for a more interesting moment of light! More shading on those rock faces would have added no end of drama to this shot - as it is, it''s at best weakly illustrative. More light and shade would add spectacle, where this is really quite flat seeming. <br/> <br/>In pure challenge terms, some foreground is needed to really emphasise dof, though of course in a sense of simple distance everything here is sharp. It''s not bad work, but the light, the light ... 5</td>', 'wonderful view - but oh for a more interesting moment of light! More shading on those rock faces would have added no end of drama to this shot - as it is, it''s at best weakly illustrative. More light and shade would add spectacle, where this is really quite flat seeming.  In pure challenge terms, some foreground is needed to really emphasise dof, though of course in a sense of simple distance everything here is sharp. It''s not bad work, but the light, the light ... 5', '2004-06-09 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(757063, 81951, 18403, '<td valign="top">Some will probably look only at this old camera without noticing the photo has very good DOF!</td>', 'Some will probably look only at this old camera without noticing the photo has very good DOF!', '2004-06-09 13:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
