(757127, 81961, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good work!  The water looks almost unreal, very beautiful.  The little sailboat to the top right, caught in the lighter stripe, makes the picture interesting IMO.  I like the "stylized" approach (stylized is not the right word, but I can''t think of the right word).  I like this.</td>', 'Good work!  The water looks almost unreal, very beautiful.  The little sailboat to the top right, caught in the lighter stripe, makes the picture interesting IMO.  I like the "stylized" approach (stylized is not the right word, but I can''t think of the right word).  I like this.', '2004-06-09 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(757129, 81132, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2004-06-09 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
