(757135, 81426, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Even the slight feathering of the border into the photo fits the mood of this picture.  Good way to show deep DOF.  Good work!  (9)</td>', 'Beautiful!  Even the slight feathering of the border into the photo fits the mood of this picture.  Good way to show deep DOF.  Good work!  (9)', '2004-06-09 14:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
