(757244, 81736, 10686, '<td valign="top">Could just crop off the top third and improve this a lot. I do like the play on words with digging in the field</td>', 'Could just crop off the top third and improve this a lot. I do like the play on words with digging in the field', '2004-06-09 15:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(757247, 81062, 10686, '<td valign="top">Help, I''m falling over.........<br/>I like the colors a lot, but, I''m not sure that the tilted horizon works here and I know I don''t like the pole in the BG, you should have cloned it out IMO.</td>', 'Help, I''m falling over.........I like the colors a lot, but, I''m not sure that the tilted horizon works here and I know I don''t like the pole in the BG, you should have cloned it out IMO.', '2004-06-09 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
