(757472, 81696, 18834, '<td valign="top">I like the photo.  I think that it would look a little better if you cropped more off the bottom, like about up to the dirt spot, or maybe crop off some of the dirt spot.  that will get people to focus more on the view than on the ground.</td>', 'I like the photo.  I think that it would look a little better if you cropped more off the bottom, like about up to the dirt spot, or maybe crop off some of the dirt spot.  that will get people to focus more on the view than on the ground.', '2004-06-09 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
