(757526, 81905, 21362, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s quite a view!</td>', 'Wow! That''s quite a view!', '2004-06-09 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(757653, 81965, 6999, '<td valign="top">That sky really hurts this image for me. Except for the positioning of the horizon, this a solid composition though, and the light and textures on the rails and ballast are well caught. Light on the treees and bushes is also good, which just makes the big white more of a pity. The fixes are quite easy - grad filters, or underexposing and bringing details back in post-pro, but for me it overwhelms this shot. 4</td>', 'That sky really hurts this image for me. Except for the positioning of the horizon, this a solid composition though, and the light and textures on the rails and ballast are well caught. Light on the treees and bushes is also good, which just makes the big white more of a pity. The fixes are quite easy - grad filters, or underexposing and bringing details back in post-pro, but for me it overwhelms this shot. 4', '2004-06-09 19:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(757668, 81132, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot indeed - especially like the way the cloud reflection blurs into the stony bed of the lake - a phenomenon I really enjoy in photographs. Have you had a look at it cropped to the horizon line, so that the hills, mountains and clouds only exist in reflection? A brief look masking off the top of frame suggests that that would make an exceptional composition (takes notes for future ...) :-)<br/> <br/>One of few shots where the heavy summer shadows are used to good effect. 7</td>', 'Nice shot indeed - especially like the way the cloud reflection blurs into the stony bed of the lake - a phenomenon I really enjoy in photographs. Have you had a look at it cropped to the horizon line, so that the hills, mountains and clouds only exist in reflection? A brief look masking off the top of frame suggests that that would make an exceptional composition (takes notes for future ...) :-) One of few shots where the heavy summer shadows are used to good effect. 7', '2004-06-09 19:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(757694, 81832, 15648, '<td valign="top">MMMMM, Morrels. I am from Michigan. We used to go up north and pick Morrels. Haven''t gone in awhile, But my buddies have been going every week. They said they picking dried up for the year. Love the picture. I gave you a 7.</td>', 'MMMMM, Morrels. I am from Michigan. We used to go up north and pick Morrels. Haven''t gone in awhile, But my buddies have been going every week. They said they picking dried up for the year. Love the picture. I gave you a 7.', '2004-06-09 19:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(757698, 81062, 15648, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it is the compression of file, BUT it is over saturated.</td>', 'I don''t know if it is the compression of file, BUT it is over saturated.', '2004-06-09 19:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(757707, 81752, 20235, '<td valign="top">The details and color saturation here are great. I think you caught this moment perfectly with the still water and reflections .... 7</td>', 'The details and color saturation here are great. I think you caught this moment perfectly with the still water and reflections .... 7', '2004-06-09 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(757715, 81668, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great detail and textures. The reflections on the water and fluid effects are nice. Color saturation is good. Picture seems slightly skewed CCW but that might just be the angle of the shoreline.... 8</td>', 'Great detail and textures. The reflections on the water and fluid effects are nice. Color saturation is good. Picture seems slightly skewed CCW but that might just be the angle of the shoreline.... 8', '2004-06-09 19:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(757721, 81684, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and detail</td>', 'Nice colors and detail', '2004-06-09 19:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(757722, 81069, 21362, '<td valign="top">Really love this one. Well done. :)</td>', 'Really love this one. Well done. :)', '2004-06-09 19:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(757724, 81776, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Often I find with panoramic city views, the inevitable "hazy horizon"  detracts from the photo. But in this case, it works so well to give your photo an almost etherial quality. The contrasting warm and cold color pallate is great and the shapes and textures make it very interesting to look at.... 8</td>', 'Great shot! Often I find with panoramic city views, the inevitable "hazy horizon"  detracts from the photo. But in this case, it works so well to give your photo an almost etherial quality. The contrasting warm and cold color pallate is great and the shapes and textures make it very interesting to look at.... 8', '2004-06-09 19:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(757727, 81965, 15648, '<td valign="top">This is nice, too bad the sky is over exposed</td>', 'This is nice, too bad the sky is over exposed', '2004-06-09 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(757732, 80826, 15648, '<td valign="top">This is great. I gave you a 7. I would have given you a 8 but I wish the nose had some detail to it.</td>', 'This is great. I gave you a 7. I would have given you a 8 but I wish the nose had some detail to it.', '2004-06-09 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(757734, 81394, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject matter and detail. One can spend alot of time examining the intricate details of the structures in this photo. The only thing I found distracting was what appears to be a slight amount of barrel distortion.... particularly evident in the column to the left. Nice photo nonetheless ...7</td>', 'Beautiful subject matter and detail. One can spend alot of time examining the intricate details of the structures in this photo. The only thing I found distracting was what appears to be a slight amount of barrel distortion.... particularly evident in the column to the left. Nice photo nonetheless ...7', '2004-06-09 19:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(757737, 81312, 15648, '<td valign="top">The colors are superb. Nice DOF.</td>', 'The colors are superb. Nice DOF.', '2004-06-09 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(757740, 81455, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast. I love it. I can see this picture hanging in my house.</td>', 'Great use of contrast. I love it. I can see this picture hanging in my house.', '2004-06-09 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(757747, 81298, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Very sexy instrument.</td>', 'Great colors. Very sexy instrument.', '2004-06-09 19:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(757750, 80655, 15648, '<td valign="top">I want to say it is a Fender. But tremelo doesn''t appear to be a Strat. Nice shot, BUT I have seen this concept a million times. BUT I feel you did a good job. Do you play? I gave you a 6.</td>', 'I want to say it is a Fender. But tremelo doesn''t appear to be a Strat. Nice shot, BUT I have seen this concept a million times. BUT I feel you did a good job. Do you play? I gave you a 6.', '2004-06-09 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(757758, 81708, 20235, '<td valign="top">Love this photo and tilte. The fish-eye effect gives it a story-book appearance.</td>', 'Love this photo and tilte. The fish-eye effect gives it a story-book appearance.', '2004-06-09 19:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(757761, 80573, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like how you achieved the challenge theme without resorting to landscape shots. Details, textures, DOF, and the warm color pallate are very nice.... 8</td>', 'Great photo. I like how you achieved the challenge theme without resorting to landscape shots. Details, textures, DOF, and the warm color pallate are very nice.... 8', '2004-06-09 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(757763, 81591, 20235, '<td valign="top">Incredible DOF and focus! The layers of colors, textures, and detail through the whole focal range really enforce the deep DOF.... 9</td>', 'Incredible DOF and focus! The layers of colors, textures, and detail through the whole focal range really enforce the deep DOF.... 9', '2004-06-09 19:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(757764, 81717, 20235, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and the framing of the shot. The detail in the distant fields is great. The stone window seems a little underexposed and the detail and textures suffer a little from this. Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Love the idea and the framing of the shot. The detail in the distant fields is great. The stone window seems a little underexposed and the detail and textures suffer a little from this. Nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-06-09 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(757766, 81822, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The layers and colors are breathtaking. Very Van Goh-ish ;)<br/>The contrast between the sky and field really makes the forground and subject "pop"..... 8</td>', 'Very nice shot. The layers and colors are breathtaking. Very Van Goh-ish ;)The contrast between the sky and field really makes the forground and subject "pop"..... 8', '2004-06-09 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(757771, 81670, 20235, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of deep DOF in this shot. I like the detail and composition here. The land seems a little dark though. Maybe adjusting levels may have helped?</td>', 'Perfect use of deep DOF in this shot. I like the detail and composition here. The land seems a little dark though. Maybe adjusting levels may have helped?', '2004-06-09 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(757773, 81907, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great composition and framing. I like the way the eye is drawn to the main subject here. Colors seem a little un-saturated and lifeless though on my monitor. Maybe some white balance and levels adjustment to help?</td>', 'Great composition and framing. I like the way the eye is drawn to the main subject here. Colors seem a little un-saturated and lifeless though on my monitor. Maybe some white balance and levels adjustment to help?', '2004-06-09 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(757782, 80457, 20235, '<td valign="top">Well, you''ve basically taken the concept of deep DOF and slapped it in the face while insuling its mother. This photo is incredible! Needless to say, the detail and focus are out of this world (no pun intended). The composition is great and the intricate textures you''ve managed to pick up make it very interesting...... I give a 9</td>', 'Well, you''ve basically taken the concept of deep DOF and slapped it in the face while insuling its mother. This photo is incredible! Needless to say, the detail and focus are out of this world (no pun intended). The composition is great and the intricate textures you''ve managed to pick up make it very interesting...... I give a 9', '2004-06-09 20:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(757797, 81132, 17148, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win I will cry...10</td>', 'If this doesn''t win I will cry...10', '2004-06-09 20:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(757798, 81953, 17148, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-06-09 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(757799, 81822, 17148, '<td valign="top">man, I''ve been looking for a single tree in the middle of a field...fantastic photo</td>', 'man, I''ve been looking for a single tree in the middle of a field...fantastic photo', '2004-06-09 20:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(757905, 81788, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great shot with details all the way back. Not sure if you tried it but if the POV was about a foot or so lower might give the benches and railing more impact. Also I might have tried a tighter crop (some off the left and right) to help with the vertical feel that you are trying to achieve with the vanishing point. Slightly oversharpened but won''t deduct. 7</td>', 'Great shot with details all the way back. Not sure if you tried it but if the POV was about a foot or so lower might give the benches and railing more impact. Also I might have tried a tighter crop (some off the left and right) to help with the vertical feel that you are trying to achieve with the vanishing point. Slightly oversharpened but won''t deduct. 7', '2004-06-09 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(757909, 81927, 8054, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s my eyes but I don''t see a lot of sharp details of the tree leaves or of the building (Sears Tower?). I see quite a bit of compression that hinders them. Color and composition are good starts and the bottom could be cropped just a bit to eliminate that odd bit sticking out of the building in the lower right.</td>', 'Maybe it''s my eyes but I don''t see a lot of sharp details of the tree leaves or of the building (Sears Tower?). I see quite a bit of compression that hinders them. Color and composition are good starts and the bottom could be cropped just a bit to eliminate that odd bit sticking out of the building in the lower right.', '2004-06-09 21:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(757913, 81684, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not quite deep DOF as the foreground and background petals are blurry. Excellent macro shot with nice details of the bee and the pollen. Almost makes me want to sneeze. :)</td>', 'Not quite deep DOF as the foreground and background petals are blurry. Excellent macro shot with nice details of the bee and the pollen. Almost makes me want to sneeze. :)', '2004-06-09 21:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(757918, 81482, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point and composition. Colors appear a bit dull and the sky lacks contrast. Maybe a UV/Haze filter and levels adjustment might help.</td>', 'Great vantage point and composition. Colors appear a bit dull and the sky lacks contrast. Maybe a UV/Haze filter and levels adjustment might help.', '2004-06-09 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(757922, 81826, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great subject but there are some things I would fix. 1. Back two flamingoes are overexposed. 2. Use a fill flash to help bring out details of the foreground flamino. 2. Clone out the branch hanging down from the top of the frame.</td>', 'Great subject but there are some things I would fix. 1. Back two flamingoes are overexposed. 2. Use a fill flash to help bring out details of the foreground flamino. 2. Clone out the branch hanging down from the top of the frame.', '2004-06-09 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(757929, 81911, 8054, '<td valign="top">OK, I don''t quite get the connection between the title and the photo as I can''t quite see any ears on the people nor can I tell if they are golden. But this is an excellent photo despite the odd title. Nice smooth conditions on the water and I can see individual trees in the hills. Even the clouds have details. I would have cropped the left side a bit more to help concentrate focus on the rest of the image which seems more important than the dirt. 7</td>', 'OK, I don''t quite get the connection between the title and the photo as I can''t quite see any ears on the people nor can I tell if they are golden. But this is an excellent photo despite the odd title. Nice smooth conditions on the water and I can see individual trees in the hills. Even the clouds have details. I would have cropped the left side a bit more to help concentrate focus on the rest of the image which seems more important than the dirt. 7', '2004-06-09 21:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(757934, 81472, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent skyline shot but I think that a deep DOF shot would also include something in the foreground as a second reference point. I love the lighting you have going on as either late afternoon or early morning and how it reflects off the glass.</td>', 'This is an excellent skyline shot but I think that a deep DOF shot would also include something in the foreground as a second reference point. I love the lighting you have going on as either late afternoon or early morning and how it reflects off the glass.', '2004-06-09 22:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(757976, 81708, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice Fisheye</td>', 'Nice Fisheye', '2004-06-09 22:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(757979, 81776, 10686, '<td valign="top">Definitely a wide view, but everything is pretty far away</td>', 'Definitely a wide view, but everything is pretty far away', '2004-06-09 22:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(757982, 81717, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the foreground is soft<br/></td>', 'Good idea, but the foreground is soft', '2004-06-09 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(757985, 81533, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the flash is too much<br/></td>', 'Nice idea, but the flash is too much', '2004-06-09 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(757987, 81747, 10686, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Space Invaders video game</td>', 'Reminds me of Space Invaders video game', '2004-06-09 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(757990, 81908, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice heat sink</td>', 'Nice heat sink', '2004-06-09 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(758065, 81069, 20247, '<td valign="top">very nice tone.. i love the feel on this one.. :D</td>', 'very nice tone.. i love the feel on this one.. :D', '2004-06-10 00:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(758106, 81840, 8054, '<td valign="top">Background seems to be well centered and appears to be the main focus of the photo. Color balance and/or white balance seem to be off slightly as there is a blue tint. Also, the flower bed seems to be at a funny angle and gives the rest of the picture an odd feel.</td>', 'Background seems to be well centered and appears to be the main focus of the photo. Color balance and/or white balance seem to be off slightly as there is a blue tint. Also, the flower bed seems to be at a funny angle and gives the rest of the picture an odd feel.', '2004-06-10 01:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(758115, 81651, 8054, '<td valign="top">What is this?  A field full of dandelions? If so, I''ve never seen so many in one place at one time. I think you applied lots of sharpening to make it look like the background was in focus but  the trees in the background are showing halos and the dandelions in the middle of the bunch are fuzzy.</td>', 'What is this?  A field full of dandelions? If so, I''ve never seen so many in one place at one time. I think you applied lots of sharpening to make it look like the background was in focus but  the trees in the background are showing halos and the dandelions in the middle of the bunch are fuzzy.', '2004-06-10 01:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(758165, 81708, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, great textures. I love the distortion on the stairs. Beautiful piece of art. It me of an Escher drawing.</td>', 'Nice contrast, great textures. I love the distortion on the stairs. Beautiful piece of art. It me of an Escher drawing.', '2004-06-10 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(758168, 81832, 20786, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of shallow DOF, not deep DOF.</td>', 'This is a great example of shallow DOF, not deep DOF.', '2004-06-10 02:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(758171, 81758, 21241, '<td valign="top">i love the reflectiopns of the clouds in the windows, nice shot</td>', 'i love the reflectiopns of the clouds in the windows, nice shot', '2004-06-10 02:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(758172, 81622, 21241, '<td valign="top">slightly overexposed.... not enough contrast</td>', 'slightly overexposed.... not enough contrast', '2004-06-10 02:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(758175, 80826, 20786, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE the composition here, only it''s not deep DOF, this is shallow.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE the composition here, only it''s not deep DOF, this is shallow.', '2004-06-10 02:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(758176, 81132, 21241, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, that fits the challenge, very nice!</td>', 'beautiful shot, that fits the challenge, very nice!', '2004-06-10 02:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(758177, 81941, 21241, '<td valign="top">very blown out and over sharpened</td>', 'very blown out and over sharpened', '2004-06-10 02:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(758178, 81212, 21241, '<td valign="top">the sky is blown out, over all this shot feels very dull to me... it needs more contrast</td>', 'the sky is blown out, over all this shot feels very dull to me... it needs more contrast', '2004-06-10 02:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(758179, 81808, 21241, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2004-06-10 02:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(758180, 81312, 21241, '<td valign="top">very nice bright vibrant colors, tons of contrast, very nice</td>', 'very nice bright vibrant colors, tons of contrast, very nice', '2004-06-10 02:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(758216, 81651, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The tree line in the distance really acts as an intermediary between the field and sky. DOF and contrast is excellent.... 8</td>', 'Great shot. The tree line in the distance really acts as an intermediary between the field and sky. DOF and contrast is excellent.... 8', '2004-06-10 03:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(758217, 81069, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and the effectiveness of the DOF here. I think the framing of the shot where the tree trunk dominates the composition is a little overwhelming. IMHO the shot would have been equally effective even if not so much trunk was visible.</td>', 'I like your idea and the effectiveness of the DOF here. I think the framing of the shot where the tree trunk dominates the composition is a little overwhelming. IMHO the shot would have been equally effective even if not so much trunk was visible.', '2004-06-10 03:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(758221, 81606, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and subject here. The contrast in shapes and colors is nice. One thing I found distracting though is the appearance of grainyness and artifacts in the sky.</td>', 'I love the composition and subject here. The contrast in shapes and colors is nice. One thing I found distracting though is the appearance of grainyness and artifacts in the sky.', '2004-06-10 03:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(758222, 81902, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. The detail and DOF is great. I''m not a fan of the darkened outer area (Pshop burn tool?) as it seems to detract from some of the detail and colors.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. The detail and DOF is great. I''m not a fan of the darkened outer area (Pshop burn tool?) as it seems to detract from some of the detail and colors.', '2004-06-10 03:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(758223, 80837, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF. On my monitor, the colors seem a little washed out from the bright sun. Polarizer or ND filter to help maybe?</td>', 'Good composition and DOF. On my monitor, the colors seem a little washed out from the bright sun. Polarizer or ND filter to help maybe?', '2004-06-10 03:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(758225, 81132, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow, this shot looks like a postcard! Great clarity and focus on detail through the whole focal range. I give an 8</td>', 'Wow, this shot looks like a postcard! Great clarity and focus on detail through the whole focal range. I give an 8', '2004-06-10 04:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(758232, 80655, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  This is a difficult picture to take, I''m sure, and you''ve done it perfectly.  I might have cropped it without the plugin, but i don''t play the guitar, so i don''t have any emotional context.  Awesome shot for the challenge. 9</td>', 'Very well done.  This is a difficult picture to take, I''m sure, and you''ve done it perfectly.  I might have cropped it without the plugin, but i don''t play the guitar, so i don''t have any emotional context.  Awesome shot for the challenge. 9', '2004-06-10 04:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(758237, 81799, 9809, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection -- it almost makes the building look transparent. The way the cloud on the left lines up with the reflection is great. Did you have to wait for just the right time, or did you just get lucky? I would have cloned out the two spots in the sky that look like dust on your sensor. Such editing is allowed in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice reflection -- it almost makes the building look transparent. The way the cloud on the left lines up with the reflection is great. Did you have to wait for just the right time, or did you just get lucky? I would have cloned out the two spots in the sky that look like dust on your sensor. Such editing is allowed in this challenge.', '2004-06-10 04:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(758239, 81832, 9809, '<td valign="top">This is the antithesis of DOF. All should be in focus for this challenge, no?</td>', 'This is the antithesis of DOF. All should be in focus for this challenge, no?', '2004-06-10 04:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(758240, 81957, 9809, '<td valign="top">Great concept and of course it''s real-- otherwise it wouldn''t meet the challenge. Excellent focus on the wrench and the wench. :)</td>', 'Great concept and of course it''s real-- otherwise it wouldn''t meet the challenge. Excellent focus on the wrench and the wench. :)', '2004-06-10 04:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(758243, 81818, 9809, '<td valign="top">This looks like San Diego to me. Am I close?<br/>Overall photo seems a bit soft and the white balance seems a bit off as well.</td>', 'This looks like San Diego to me. Am I close?Overall photo seems a bit soft and the white balance seems a bit off as well.', '2004-06-10 04:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(758254, 81507, 19708, '<td valign="top">Really little that is actually in focus.<br/>Depth of field shallow, not deep.</td>', 'Really little that is actually in focus.Depth of field shallow, not deep.', '2004-06-10 04:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(758265, 81684, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro with great clarity, but<br/>not really deep depth of field in all actuality.<br/>Maybe proportion deep dof?</td>', 'Nice Macro with great clarity, butnot really deep depth of field in all actuality.Maybe proportion deep dof?', '2004-06-10 04:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(758321, 81550, 6172, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, do you understand what "Deep DOF" is?</td>', 'I''m sorry, do you understand what "Deep DOF" is?', '2004-06-10 06:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(758322, 81271, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very rustic, I like the lighting- only the barn seems a little too dark.</td>', 'Very rustic, I like the lighting- only the barn seems a little too dark.', '2004-06-10 06:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(758336, 81574, 6999, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge, and follows the ''rules'' - main subect not centre-frame, horizon not centre-frame. In simple terms of those rules, however, you''ve placed the rusted thing too far off-centre - I''d have allowed more room for it to breathe in the composition, brought it if you like onto the conjunction of the thirds lines, rather than in the bottom right box created by those lines.<br/> <br/>However, all of that is incidental to the fact that the light is all wrong - very harsh, very contrasty, and giving you little help with the definition of these things, nor of the distance of the composition. There do seem to be textures in the metal plates worthy of interest, but this does little to show the detail of them. There''s also a great deal of distracting detail in the shot, at least that adds little to my viewing of it: stones in the sand, other lumps and metal things around, the confusion of posts, people and the boat - which are not necessarily bad things, depending on your intention and organisation of those things, but for dpc they most definitely are. 4</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge, and follows the ''rules'' - main subect not centre-frame, horizon not centre-frame. In simple terms of those rules, however, you''ve placed the rusted thing too far off-centre - I''d have allowed more room for it to breathe in the composition, brought it if you like onto the conjunction of the thirds lines, rather than in the bottom right box created by those lines. However, all of that is incidental to the fact that the light is all wrong - very harsh, very contrasty, and giving you little help with the definition of these things, nor of the distance of the composition. There do seem to be textures in the metal plates worthy of interest, but this does little to show the detail of them. There''s also a great deal of distracting detail in the shot, at least that adds little to my viewing of it: stones in the sand, other lumps and metal things around, the confusion of posts, people and the boat - which are not necessarily bad things, depending on your intention and organisation of those things, but for dpc they most definitely are. 4', '2004-06-10 07:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(758338, 80748, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot, good detail, good use of the light. I''m not convinced about the crop - kind of get the sense that you wern''t yourself, you know - the cutting off of the trees, the space image left. Certainly meets the challenge, for me - though in a way i think some voters might miss, especially those who don''t give it the time. 6</td>', 'Good clean shot, good detail, good use of the light. I''m not convinced about the crop - kind of get the sense that you wern''t yourself, you know - the cutting off of the trees, the space image left. Certainly meets the challenge, for me - though in a way i think some voters might miss, especially those who don''t give it the time. 6', '2004-06-10 07:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(758340, 81908, 6999, '<td valign="top">Refreshing - though I''m not sure you''re going to get away with it in terms of the voters. Like the abstractness of it, though I find the composition of it a touch annoying - tiny bit obvious, if you follow me - and the light kind of blunt: whilst the darkness and the blue are intriguing, I can''t help but wonder if a little fill (and only a little) might have added some three-dimensionality, some depth. Slightest feeling of missing details, but that miguth only be that light again. 7</td>', 'Refreshing - though I''m not sure you''re going to get away with it in terms of the voters. Like the abstractness of it, though I find the composition of it a touch annoying - tiny bit obvious, if you follow me - and the light kind of blunt: whilst the darkness and the blue are intriguing, I can''t help but wonder if a little fill (and only a little) might have added some three-dimensionality, some depth. Slightest feeling of missing details, but that miguth only be that light again. 7', '2004-06-10 07:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(758342, 81781, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think, and it''s only opinion of course, that those clouds need to be darkened considerably to have the impact your title suggest: this way, it looks just like a bit of cloud cover on a sometimes sunny day. beyond that, this a good solid composition, nicely organised to balance the girl and the buildings. I might wish that there were more drama in it, more impact if you were to threaten the high scores. Given this scene, what would one do to give it that impact? First off, a lot of burning on those clouds, to add drama to them (see Heida''s work with the burn tool for an idea), and I''m not sure that a touch of colour temperature correction wouldn''t hurt - whole thing comes across as a little blue. 6</td>', 'I think, and it''s only opinion of course, that those clouds need to be darkened considerably to have the impact your title suggest: this way, it looks just like a bit of cloud cover on a sometimes sunny day. beyond that, this a good solid composition, nicely organised to balance the girl and the buildings. I might wish that there were more drama in it, more impact if you were to threaten the high scores. Given this scene, what would one do to give it that impact? First off, a lot of burning on those clouds, to add drama to them (see Heida''s work with the burn tool for an idea), and I''m not sure that a touch of colour temperature correction wouldn''t hurt - whole thing comes across as a little blue. 6', '2004-06-10 07:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(758345, 81837, 16241, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-06-10 07:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(758347, 81069, 20572, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Reminds me of a Henry More sculpture.</td>', 'Wonderful. Reminds me of a Henry More sculpture.', '2004-06-10 07:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(758351, 81831, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''ve by-passed this one a couple of times - I guess I''d better try and write something about it :-) can''t make up my mind, you see. The composition, other than those extra leaves/branches upper left and right about which I''m not sure, is fine, but I would say that perhaps the definition of those trees needs work - dodging/burning perhaps, something just to bring out the depth of light and shade there. The light you''ve chosen is really quite blank (which suits the compositional idea), but there''s so little here to hold the eye in terms of texture, of variety of subject (the grass, the road and the sky are all near solid areas of colour). Perhaps it needs a deeper air of mystery, which at the moment is missing somewhat. 6</td>', 'I''ve by-passed this one a couple of times - I guess I''d better try and write something about it :-) can''t make up my mind, you see. The composition, other than those extra leaves/branches upper left and right about which I''m not sure, is fine, but I would say that perhaps the definition of those trees needs work - dodging/burning perhaps, something just to bring out the depth of light and shade there. The light you''ve chosen is really quite blank (which suits the compositional idea), but there''s so little here to hold the eye in terms of texture, of variety of subject (the grass, the road and the sky are all near solid areas of colour). Perhaps it needs a deeper air of mystery, which at the moment is missing somewhat. 6', '2004-06-10 07:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(758370, 81723, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent, simple composition - exactly what I was expecting for this challenge, which is not always a bad thing. Great colour, great detail - I wish more people would simply choose the right time of day to try and take this kind of shot. Not exceptional - would perhaps want more drama in the sky for that, or something - but certainly very good indeed. 8</td>', 'Excellent, simple composition - exactly what I was expecting for this challenge, which is not always a bad thing. Great colour, great detail - I wish more people would simply choose the right time of day to try and take this kind of shot. Not exceptional - would perhaps want more drama in the sky for that, or something - but certainly very good indeed. 8', '2004-06-10 08:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(758410, 81660, 17013, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot, plenty of DOF but for me it''s the waterfall that does it</td>', 'This is a terrific shot, plenty of DOF but for me it''s the waterfall that does it', '2004-06-10 09:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(758416, 81827, 5982, '<td valign="top">the dof is not deep, to the opposite it is blurred.</td>', 'the dof is not deep, to the opposite it is blurred.', '2004-06-10 09:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(758417, 81710, 5982, '<td valign="top">dof is not deep, but blurred</td>', 'dof is not deep, but blurred', '2004-06-10 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(758434, 81799, 7743, '<td valign="top">The clouds blend nicely from sky to reflection, however I think the contrast needs a bit of a boost in the reflection.  The pattern of the windows also adds some nice texture to your image. 7</td>', 'The clouds blend nicely from sky to reflection, however I think the contrast needs a bit of a boost in the reflection.  The pattern of the windows also adds some nice texture to your image. 7', '2004-06-10 10:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(758436, 81806, 7743, '<td valign="top">Even though the person is almost in the centre, the composition works since the dramatic clouds seem to converge on his position.  Great positioning of the horizon to emphasize the clouds.  A little more contrast in the clouds may give the image even more impact. 9</td>', 'Even though the person is almost in the centre, the composition works since the dramatic clouds seem to converge on his position.  Great positioning of the horizon to emphasize the clouds.  A little more contrast in the clouds may give the image even more impact. 9', '2004-06-10 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(758468, 81817, 22861, '<td valign="top">Very good geometry</td>', 'Very good geometry', '2004-06-10 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(758486, 80655, 20941, '<td valign="top">great subject, chrystal clear!</td>', 'great subject, chrystal clear!', '2004-06-10 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(758489, 81132, 7743, '<td valign="top">Well balanced, well exposed.  Must be very early since the water is so still.  Great clarity in the reflection.  There seems to be a little noise in the sky which is probably due to jpeg compression.<br/> <br/>Well done. 10<br/> <br/>edit... I had to correct the spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-14 01:06:40.</i></td>', 'Well balanced, well exposed.  Must be very early since the water is so still.  Great clarity in the reflection.  There seems to be a little noise in the sky which is probably due to jpeg compression. Well done. 10 edit... I had to correct the spelling', '2004-06-10 10:48:22.000000', '2004-06-14 02:06:40.000000', 1),
(758557, 80573, 18834, '<td valign="top">good shot, but a little out of focus</td>', 'good shot, but a little out of focus', '2004-06-10 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(758559, 81752, 18834, '<td valign="top">very dark, maybe a not enough exposure time.  bump up the contrast</td>', 'very dark, maybe a not enough exposure time.  bump up the contrast', '2004-06-10 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(758560, 81797, 22869, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, great colors and DOF</td>', 'Nicely composed, great colors and DOF', '2004-06-10 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(758564, 81271, 18834, '<td valign="top">maybe you could have cropped a little closer to the fence, and im assuming you took this later in the day so it is really dark.  nice mountains</td>', 'maybe you could have cropped a little closer to the fence, and im assuming you took this later in the day so it is really dark.  nice mountains', '2004-06-10 12:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(758585, 81956, 6999, '<td valign="top">well now, what has happened to that sky? Beyond that, you have apotentially good scene here - the light, especially on those more distant trees, is lovely. A bit hit and miss in the foreground, i think - perhaps if you''d shot from lower you would have a happier composition? Just that change of a couple of feet in point of view can make an extraordinary difference. But that sky colour wrecks this shot for me, I''m afraid. 5</td>', 'well now, what has happened to that sky? Beyond that, you have apotentially good scene here - the light, especially on those more distant trees, is lovely. A bit hit and miss in the foreground, i think - perhaps if you''d shot from lower you would have a happier composition? Just that change of a couple of feet in point of view can make an extraordinary difference. But that sky colour wrecks this shot for me, I''m afraid. 5', '2004-06-10 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(758588, 81930, 6999, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s throwing the rock - I''m guessing that the intention is that it''s heading towards him. Or if it''s to do with people below, then why''s the rock so high in the air? That confusion is at the heart of what i don''t like about this shot. The rest is the awfully flat light, and the odd composition, with that background hill behind him. I don''t understand why you haven''t profiled him against the sky more. 4</td>', 'Looks like he''s throwing the rock - I''m guessing that the intention is that it''s heading towards him. Or if it''s to do with people below, then why''s the rock so high in the air? That confusion is at the heart of what i don''t like about this shot. The rest is the awfully flat light, and the odd composition, with that background hill behind him. I don''t understand why you haven''t profiled him against the sky more. 4', '2004-06-10 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(758595, 81472, 6999, '<td valign="top">Er ... slight issue with the ''night'' bit from where I''m looking :-) Don''t really see this fitting - your subject is in such a flat plane, and so distant, that depth of field, deep or shallow, has little to do with anything. Technically a good cityscape, but had you waited for the sky to darken a bit more it would probably have more impact. As it stands, whilst being a perfectly competent shot technically, it lacks much impact for me. 5</td>', 'Er ... slight issue with the ''night'' bit from where I''m looking :-) Don''t really see this fitting - your subject is in such a flat plane, and so distant, that depth of field, deep or shallow, has little to do with anything. Technically a good cityscape, but had you waited for the sky to darken a bit more it would probably have more impact. As it stands, whilst being a perfectly competent shot technically, it lacks much impact for me. 5', '2004-06-10 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(758598, 81915, 17166, '<td valign="top">Took me about two minutes of staring but I''m pretty sure I know how this was done.  Very clever use of photoshop to create this while staying in the rules.</td>', 'Took me about two minutes of staring but I''m pretty sure I know how this was done.  Very clever use of photoshop to create this while staying in the rules.', '2004-06-10 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(758677, 81181, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good clouds. I like the lamp as the foreground element with the background being a pretty backdrop. Color looks good, so does focus, and a fairly sharp shot.</td>', 'Good clouds. I like the lamp as the foreground element with the background being a pretty backdrop. Color looks good, so does focus, and a fairly sharp shot.', '2004-06-10 13:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(758680, 81795, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good layers and colors with a nice dramatic sky. No distracting or cluttered background, which is good. Angle of the track is good and also some negative space for the train to move into. Looks good.</td>', 'Good layers and colors with a nice dramatic sky. No distracting or cluttered background, which is good. Angle of the track is good and also some negative space for the train to move into. Looks good.', '2004-06-10 13:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(758682, 81747, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, they all look like they are at the same depth, just different sizes. An interesting and colorful chaotic pattern. A fortunate opportunity.</td>', 'It''s interesting, they all look like they are at the same depth, just different sizes. An interesting and colorful chaotic pattern. A fortunate opportunity.', '2004-06-10 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(758686, 81289, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mix of layers from foreground to the mountainous backdrop. Nice dramatic sky too. Composition is good - a very serene and pretty spot.</td>', 'Wonderful mix of layers from foreground to the mountainous backdrop. Nice dramatic sky too. Composition is good - a very serene and pretty spot.', '2004-06-10 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(758688, 81935, 6008, '<td valign="top">The odd perspective bothers me a bit here, but that''s a personal opinion. I do like the relative size difference between the cleaners and the size of the windows.</td>', 'The odd perspective bothers me a bit here, but that''s a personal opinion. I do like the relative size difference between the cleaners and the size of the windows.', '2004-06-10 13:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(758690, 81557, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky indeed! Interesting perspective too. Seems very foreboding and ominous, like a scene from a sci-fi movie. A bit of noise in the sky probably due to over processing, but it''s not too distracting.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky indeed! Interesting perspective too. Seems very foreboding and ominous, like a scene from a sci-fi movie. A bit of noise in the sky probably due to over processing, but it''s not too distracting.', '2004-06-10 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(758693, 81781, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot with the background cloaked in this very blue stormy mood and yet the lighting on the foreground person and grass is very bright and summery. Excellent mix of foreground/background elements, wonderful lighting and color, interesting mood, nice sharp image. Nicely captured!</td>', 'Very interesting shot with the background cloaked in this very blue stormy mood and yet the lighting on the foreground person and grass is very bright and summery. Excellent mix of foreground/background elements, wonderful lighting and color, interesting mood, nice sharp image. Nicely captured!', '2004-06-10 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(758696, 81927, 18834, '<td valign="top">Its alittle out of focus, and i think that cropping off a little more of the right will make the building centered</td>', 'Its alittle out of focus, and i think that cropping off a little more of the right will make the building centered', '2004-06-10 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(758699, 81957, 18834, '<td valign="top">great shot, Its amazing how clear both the wrench and the person are. 7</td>', 'great shot, Its amazing how clear both the wrench and the person are. 7', '2004-06-10 14:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(758701, 81949, 18834, '<td valign="top">to center the street, it would look better if you cropped off some of the left, but for your dof of the building, I thnk you should have cropped off more of the right.</td>', 'to center the street, it would look better if you cropped off some of the left, but for your dof of the building, I thnk you should have cropped off more of the right.', '2004-06-10 14:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(758702, 80694, 6008, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective here and the geometric feel of the image. The grey of the pole and the blue of the sky are very complimentary. Normally it is said to avoid center compositions but I dont know if this would look any better in a different position. It has a very futuristic feel to it. Nicely captured!</td>', 'Love the perspective here and the geometric feel of the image. The grey of the pole and the blue of the sky are very complimentary. Normally it is said to avoid center compositions but I dont know if this would look any better in a different position. It has a very futuristic feel to it. Nicely captured!', '2004-06-10 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(758706, 81961, 18834, '<td valign="top">good shot, a very large dof, but It''s really dark.  maybe the exposure could have been lengthend</td>', 'good shot, a very large dof, but It''s really dark.  maybe the exposure could have been lengthend', '2004-06-10 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(758710, 81524, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, neato scenery! Wide angle? The colors are great, exposure looks spot on, subject has interest and symmetery. Really like it! Good luck</td>', 'Wow, neato scenery! Wide angle? The colors are great, exposure looks spot on, subject has interest and symmetery. Really like it! Good luck', '2004-06-10 14:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(758768, 81501, 19737, '<td valign="top">oversaturated</td>', 'oversaturated', '2004-06-10 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
