(758786, 81477, 18834, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but I think you should have cropped off more on the left to center the dock. 8</td>', 'nice photo, but I think you should have cropped off more on the left to center the dock. 8', '2004-06-10 16:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
