(759964, 81135, 11738, '<td valign="top">One of the very few macros that meets the challenge requirements.  Superb job on focus and lighting.  B&amp;W is also very good choice.  I also like the halo-ing you achieved with this shot - burning?  Good luck.</td>', 'One of the very few macros that meets the challenge requirements.  Superb job on focus and lighting.  B&W is also very good choice.  I also like the halo-ing you achieved with this shot - burning?  Good luck.', '2004-06-11 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(759965, 81708, 11738, '<td valign="top">Woah?  Looks like the view of some drunk dude trying to get to his flat.  Very cool perspective.  Fisheye lens?  Too bad that second stair is out of focus.</td>', 'Woah?  Looks like the view of some drunk dude trying to get to his flat.  Very cool perspective.  Fisheye lens?  Too bad that second stair is out of focus.', '2004-06-11 18:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(759968, 81909, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a coin shot in front of an image/monitor.  Too bad about the graininess of the thumb and the blown out thumbnail.</td>', 'Nice shot of a coin shot in front of an image/monitor.  Too bad about the graininess of the thumb and the blown out thumbnail.', '2004-06-11 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(759971, 81684, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice clear focus throughout this macro shot.  You meet challenge requirements IMHO.  Nice vibrat orange.  The shot does seem a bit grainy along the top edge of the image.</td>', 'Nice clear focus throughout this macro shot.  You meet challenge requirements IMHO.  Nice vibrat orange.  The shot does seem a bit grainy along the top edge of the image.', '2004-06-11 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(759975, 81062, 11738, '<td valign="top">Red channel oevrdone that seems to have caused a loss of sharpness... and I just can''t get used to that lean.  Beautiful poppy field.  You are so lucky to have access to such a beautiful field of flowers.</td>', 'Red channel oevrdone that seems to have caused a loss of sharpness... and I just can''t get used to that lean.  Beautiful poppy field.  You are so lucky to have access to such a beautiful field of flowers.', '2004-06-11 18:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(759978, 81606, 11738, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot but way too grainy.  Could have used a few runs through NeatImage.  I think the graininess could have worked if the shot had been duotone or B&amp;W.  Also, you could have cloned out those two pale windows.</td>', 'Sweet shot but way too grainy.  Could have used a few runs through NeatImage.  I think the graininess could have worked if the shot had been duotone or B&W.  Also, you could have cloned out those two pale windows.', '2004-06-11 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(759981, 81957, 11738, '<td valign="top">Sweeeet!  Great idea and flawless execution!  A ribbon winner in my book.</td>', 'Sweeeet!  Great idea and flawless execution!  A ribbon winner in my book.', '2004-06-11 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(759982, 81915, 22781, '<td valign="top">A bit to much photoshop....</td>', 'A bit to much photoshop....', '2004-06-11 18:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(759992, 80655, 11738, '<td valign="top">Now that is nice!  Great macro that fully meets challenge requirements.  Among my ribbon winners.</td>', 'Now that is nice!  Great macro that fully meets challenge requirements.  Among my ribbon winners.', '2004-06-11 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(760006, 81472, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape but you have no object in foregroud of any kind, therefore no way for us to judge the deepness of the depth of field.  Those buildinfs all far enough away that the lens set at infinity takes the shot no problem.  Should have kept some foreground elements.</td>', 'Nice cityscape but you have no object in foregroud of any kind, therefore no way for us to judge the deepness of the depth of field.  Those buildinfs all far enough away that the lens set at infinity takes the shot no problem.  Should have kept some foreground elements.', '2004-06-11 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(760012, 81938, 14863, '<td valign="top">Interesting...is this really depth of field though? Cool pic tho, great job</td>', 'Interesting...is this really depth of field though? Cool pic tho, great job', '2004-06-11 19:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(760013, 81956, 14863, '<td valign="top">Geese! Cute cute. I like this one- it''s a little bright, I wish we could see everything a little better but good job</td>', 'Geese! Cute cute. I like this one- it''s a little bright, I wish we could see everything a little better but good job', '2004-06-11 19:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(760014, 81779, 14863, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, pretty pretty! The colors are a little screwy though but otherwise this is awesome</td>', 'Ooooh, pretty pretty! The colors are a little screwy though but otherwise this is awesome', '2004-06-11 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(760016, 81910, 14863, '<td valign="top">Hehe, funny stuff- good shot! Nice depth of field</td>', 'Hehe, funny stuff- good shot! Nice depth of field', '2004-06-11 19:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(760017, 81550, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wow- this is awesome- love the b&amp;w- great great idea. I dunno if this has a lot of depth of field but I sure hope it does ''cause I really like and I''m a-ratin'' it high- 9 :D</td>', 'Wow- this is awesome- love the b&w- great great idea. I dunno if this has a lot of depth of field but I sure hope it does ''cause I really like and I''m a-ratin'' it high- 9 :D', '2004-06-11 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(760018, 81717, 14863, '<td valign="top">Hmm, very very cool. I really like this- I think a better closer crop would make this look much better ''cause the frame isn''t very attractive but otherwise great job :)</td>', 'Hmm, very very cool. I really like this- I think a better closer crop would make this look much better ''cause the frame isn''t very attractive but otherwise great job :)', '2004-06-11 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(760019, 81539, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wild thang, dah dah dah dah! That looks like so much fun! Great job- I vote you high good sir, or madam :D I love the clouds and the color of the green- the only issue I''ve got is the darkness- I wish the girl wasn''t floating away out of the picture but otherwise awesome 8</td>', 'Wild thang, dah dah dah dah! That looks like so much fun! Great job- I vote you high good sir, or madam :D I love the clouds and the color of the green- the only issue I''ve got is the darkness- I wish the girl wasn''t floating away out of the picture but otherwise awesome 8', '2004-06-11 19:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(760020, 81915, 14863, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha! A tad bit of cloning I see- Cute idea but a little tech know how would make this look much better. Good job though</td>', 'Hahahaha! A tad bit of cloning I see- Cute idea but a little tech know how would make this look much better. Good job though', '2004-06-11 19:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(760023, 81591, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wowey wow wow wow. This is so cool! I LOVE the clouds- the different colors and the texture, awesome job whoever you are. The hay, ah, it breaks my heart :D 10 (pst, I hope you win)</td>', 'Wowey wow wow wow. This is so cool! I LOVE the clouds- the different colors and the texture, awesome job whoever you are. The hay, ah, it breaks my heart :D 10 (pst, I hope you win)', '2004-06-11 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(760024, 81579, 14863, '<td valign="top">OK, awesome! This is so cool. I feel scared just looking at this. Like someone''s gonna beat me up OR hand me a frapacinno. The clouds are so great, they''re scary but very calming. Great job 10</td>', 'OK, awesome! This is so cool. I feel scared just looking at this. Like someone''s gonna beat me up OR hand me a frapacinno. The clouds are so great, they''re scary but very calming. Great job 10', '2004-06-11 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(760025, 81964, 14863, '<td valign="top">Ooh, verrrry tricky. Me likey. I feel like it''s a bit of a tight squeeze but it''s great job 8</td>', 'Ooh, verrrry tricky. Me likey. I feel like it''s a bit of a tight squeeze but it''s great job 8', '2004-06-11 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(760026, 81472, 14863, '<td valign="top">Pretty! A tad bright but I really like the boldness and arrogance of those colors- they wanna be there and they don''t care if it''s getting dark, damn it they''re gonna look good. This is great- I really like it- 9</td>', 'Pretty! A tad bright but I really like the boldness and arrogance of those colors- they wanna be there and they don''t care if it''s getting dark, damn it they''re gonna look good. This is great- I really like it- 9', '2004-06-11 19:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(760029, 81296, 14863, '<td valign="top">Cool idea- the lilacs are really dark though. If you could have gotten both colored right this would be really cool</td>', 'Cool idea- the lilacs are really dark though. If you could have gotten both colored right this would be really cool', '2004-06-11 19:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(760032, 81493, 14863, '<td valign="top">Very interesting- a different kind of shot- I dunno but I feel that that copper thingy isn''t neccesary- that it might have been cooler if it was just those lines. Anyway, great job and great texture on the wood</td>', 'Very interesting- a different kind of shot- I dunno but I feel that that copper thingy isn''t neccesary- that it might have been cooler if it was just those lines. Anyway, great job and great texture on the wood', '2004-06-11 19:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(760035, 81477, 14863, '<td valign="top">AWWW! Puggy dog! I love puggy dogs- SO CUTE! OK-anyway, this is adorable and very good showing of DOF- the water''s a little yucky color but that ain''t your fault. Give your puggy a big ol'' hug for me!</td>', 'AWWW! Puggy dog! I love puggy dogs- SO CUTE! OK-anyway, this is adorable and very good showing of DOF- the water''s a little yucky color but that ain''t your fault. Give your puggy a big ol'' hug for me!', '2004-06-11 19:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(760036, 81758, 14863, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOh, I love this shots- I can see 100 of them and they''re still awesome. This is just good good good. 9</td>', 'OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOh, I love this shots- I can see 100 of them and they''re still awesome. This is just good good good. 9', '2004-06-11 19:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(760037, 81186, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool idea and nice capture of the rainbow. It feels like the sautration got bumped a little past it''s breaking point but it''s very cool and good DOF.</td>', 'Wow, cool idea and nice capture of the rainbow. It feels like the sautration got bumped a little past it''s breaking point but it''s very cool and good DOF.', '2004-06-11 19:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(760038, 81961, 14863, '<td valign="top">Simple yet quite poignant- interesting idea- me likey- good colors and I just like the simplicity of it</td>', 'Simple yet quite poignant- interesting idea- me likey- good colors and I just like the simplicity of it', '2004-06-11 19:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(760040, 81151, 14863, '<td valign="top">Wow- I wish I had a castle by my house :( *tear* The texture on those bricks are amazing! and that sky, good lord that''s cool. I hope you win buddy ''cause then you can take me for a ride in  your moat and I can have fun in the jousting area. 10 10 10</td>', 'Wow- I wish I had a castle by my house :( *tear* The texture on those bricks are amazing! and that sky, good lord that''s cool. I hope you win buddy ''cause then you can take me for a ride in  your moat and I can have fun in the jousting area. 10 10 10', '2004-06-11 19:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(760044, 81684, 14863, '<td valign="top">AHHH! BEE! This is really freakin'' me out, I hope you appreciate that I''m commenting on this ''cause that requires me to keep seeing the scary bee from the corner of my eye. You make me cry little tear, buddy. This is so cool- how the hell did you get that close in- even if it''s not a live bee that''s still quite impressive. The colors are awesome. I hope you place high ''cause this is great. 10</td>', 'AHHH! BEE! This is really freakin'' me out, I hope you appreciate that I''m commenting on this ''cause that requires me to keep seeing the scary bee from the corner of my eye. You make me cry little tear, buddy. This is so cool- how the hell did you get that close in- even if it''s not a live bee that''s still quite impressive. The colors are awesome. I hope you place high ''cause this is great. 10', '2004-06-11 19:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(760048, 81816, 14863, '<td valign="top">Run man run! That looks mighty dangerous but this is quite cool so that poor runner sacrificed her life for the good of this shot. I like the sky and the matter of fact-ness of this shot- it has a real quality to it which is great. 7</td>', 'Run man run! That looks mighty dangerous but this is quite cool so that poor runner sacrificed her life for the good of this shot. I like the sky and the matter of fact-ness of this shot- it has a real quality to it which is great. 7', '2004-06-11 19:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(760051, 81818, 14863, '<td valign="top">Aw, no title? Sad... this is cool but a little out of focus. Maybe a tripod of something like that could have really helped but this is good none the less.</td>', 'Aw, no title? Sad... this is cool but a little out of focus. Maybe a tripod of something like that could have really helped but this is good none the less.', '2004-06-11 19:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(760053, 81827, 14863, '<td valign="top">Bambi! Run lil'' guy, run! This is really cool- but unfortuantely I don''t really see the DOF but I really like this- Look at him go- it''s so cool. 7</td>', 'Bambi! Run lil'' guy, run! This is really cool- but unfortuantely I don''t really see the DOF but I really like this- Look at him go- it''s so cool. 7', '2004-06-11 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
