(760995, 81776, 6520, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2004-06-12 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(761129, 81591, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! Very bright all around, good details of the hay and the clouds. I think the perspective might look better if taken a bit lower at the same level as the hay. Or maybe you just wanted to show all of them. Anyway, good job! 9</td>', 'Very nice shot! Very bright all around, good details of the hay and the clouds. I think the perspective might look better if taken a bit lower at the same level as the hay. Or maybe you just wanted to show all of them. Anyway, good job! 9', '2004-06-13 03:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(761130, 81821, 8054, '<td valign="top">The only problem I have with this image is the flash lighting of the plant as it''s quite harsh. If the lighting was softened a bit it would look very good with the cloud background.</td>', 'The only problem I have with this image is the flash lighting of the plant as it''s quite harsh. If the lighting was softened a bit it would look very good with the cloud background.', '2004-06-13 03:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(761131, 81622, 8054, '<td valign="top">Flash lighting is very bright and washes out many details.</td>', 'Flash lighting is very bright and washes out many details.', '2004-06-13 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(761133, 81524, 8054, '<td valign="top">Amazing wide angle shot! This is one of my favorites by far. Excellent color of the water and rocks. What would make this picture even better still would be some sky and clouds ALL in focus to really give a feeling of depth. But as it is, I would not change a thing. 10</td>', 'Amazing wide angle shot! This is one of my favorites by far. Excellent color of the water and rocks. What would make this picture even better still would be some sky and clouds ALL in focus to really give a feeling of depth. But as it is, I would not change a thing. 10', '2004-06-13 03:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(761134, 81832, 8054, '<td valign="top">Deep DOF means everything in the frame must be in focus. I''m sure you''ve read that by now so I''lll comment on other parts. The foreground mushroom seems a bit oversharpened. The other two show signs of compression. Lighting is a bit strong, too.</td>', 'Deep DOF means everything in the frame must be in focus. I''m sure you''ve read that by now so I''lll comment on other parts. The foreground mushroom seems a bit oversharpened. The other two show signs of compression. Lighting is a bit strong, too.', '2004-06-13 03:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(761135, 81727, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is incredible. The grasshopper(?) is in focus with its silhouette and the moon''s craters are also well focused. Not the most appealing due to the color but from a technical aspect VERY impressive. 9</td>', 'This is incredible. The grasshopper(?) is in focus with its silhouette and the moon''s craters are also well focused. Not the most appealing due to the color but from a technical aspect VERY impressive. 9', '2004-06-13 04:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(761137, 81919, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge. Details are fairly sharp throughout the frame. Only problem is the photo seems a bit overexposed. Try a faster shutter or one stop down on aperature or tweak levels a bit. Good effort! 7</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge. Details are fairly sharp throughout the frame. Only problem is the photo seems a bit overexposed. Try a faster shutter or one stop down on aperature or tweak levels a bit. Good effort! 7', '2004-06-13 04:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(761139, 80457, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is an EXCELLENT shot of the moon, however, there is no foreground to compare with the background. Both the foreground and the background need to be in focus for deep DOF.</td>', 'This is an EXCELLENT shot of the moon, however, there is no foreground to compare with the background. Both the foreground and the background need to be in focus for deep DOF.', '2004-06-13 04:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(761141, 81825, 8054, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for my liking but overall it''s an excellent picture. Love the duotone/sepia look and the dark sky. 8</td>', 'A bit too dark for my liking but overall it''s an excellent picture. Love the duotone/sepia look and the dark sky. 8', '2004-06-13 04:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(761142, 81808, 8054, '<td valign="top">Too blurry/out of focus.</td>', 'Too blurry/out of focus.', '2004-06-13 04:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(761145, 81806, 8054, '<td valign="top">This another of my favorites. The title is so perfect.  I wish there was a bit more fill lighting on the person to give a slight contrast to the dark sky but it is very good as it is. 9</td>', 'This another of my favorites. The title is so perfect.  I wish there was a bit more fill lighting on the person to give a slight contrast to the dark sky but it is very good as it is. 9', '2004-06-13 04:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(761146, 81627, 8054, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if it had less sharpening and wasn''t as noisy.</td>', 'I would like this more if it had less sharpening and wasn''t as noisy.', '2004-06-13 04:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(761147, 81132, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot! Love the stillness of the water as they reflect the clouds above. And I also like how the dock leads the eyes into the middle of the photo. 10</td>', 'This is a very good shot! Love the stillness of the water as they reflect the clouds above. And I also like how the dock leads the eyes into the middle of the photo. 10', '2004-06-13 04:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(761148, 81942, 8054, '<td valign="top">I find the thick horizontal stem is slightly distracting to the overall feel of this photo. It should have been removed or cropped out. Details are very good and lighting and contrast are also good. Sky shows some compression but not enough to subtract points. Border is a bit too thick for my tastes. 7</td>', 'I find the thick horizontal stem is slightly distracting to the overall feel of this photo. It should have been removed or cropped out. Details are very good and lighting and contrast are also good. Sky shows some compression but not enough to subtract points. Border is a bit too thick for my tastes. 7', '2004-06-13 04:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(761149, 81455, 8054, '<td valign="top">A bit on the dark side for me. But I do love the level of detail you''ve managed to capture. Excellent composition. 7</td>', 'A bit on the dark side for me. But I do love the level of detail you''ve managed to capture. Excellent composition. 7', '2004-06-13 04:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(761178, 81132, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Excellent DOF. You are right on with this one. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Excellent DOF. You are right on with this one. One of my favorites.', '2004-06-13 07:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(761179, 81776, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well done cityscape. Excellent DOF.</td>', 'Very well done cityscape. Excellent DOF.', '2004-06-13 07:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(761180, 81684, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well done Macro with excellent DOF. I like that you put the subject in the lower right hand corner rather than the center. The colors are quite appealing. Good job.</td>', 'Very well done Macro with excellent DOF. I like that you put the subject in the lower right hand corner rather than the center. The colors are quite appealing. Good job.', '2004-06-13 07:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(761182, 81837, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like your picture. The pattern is very interesting. It may not do as well in this challenge as it would have in another like the "Centered" challenge because there are other pictures with a more obvious greater DOF, but I still like it.</td>', 'I really like your picture. The pattern is very interesting. It may not do as well in this challenge as it would have in another like the "Centered" challenge because there are other pictures with a more obvious greater DOF, but I still like it.', '2004-06-13 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(761183, 81651, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very good placement on you picture. It really brings the viewer into the scene. I hear dandelion wine is very good!</td>', 'Very good placement on you picture. It really brings the viewer into the scene. I hear dandelion wine is very good!', '2004-06-13 07:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(761185, 81528, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of your picture. The tree in the backround is also a nice touch. I will be interested to see where this picture was taken as the corn is quite high for this time of year in my part of the country.</td>', 'I like the placement of your picture. The tree in the backround is also a nice touch. I will be interested to see where this picture was taken as the corn is quite high for this time of year in my part of the country.', '2004-06-13 07:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(761186, 81072, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have followed the rules of photography very nicely here. I like the way you have captured a single car on this windy road. Excellent colors, DOF and interest. One of my favorites.</td>', 'You have followed the rules of photography very nicely here. I like the way you have captured a single car on this windy road. Excellent colors, DOF and interest. One of my favorites.', '2004-06-13 07:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(761190, 81606, 3306, '<td valign="top">You captured this picture at the perfect moment. Excellent lighting, almost ominous. I get the feeling you were trying to elicit the memories of 9/11. You have done it.</td>', 'You captured this picture at the perfect moment. Excellent lighting, almost ominous. I get the feeling you were trying to elicit the memories of 9/11. You have done it.', '2004-06-13 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(761191, 81677, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your picture is a good one and would have scored well in the "centered" challenge, but I fear it will not do as well here as the DOF is not well represented.</td>', 'Your picture is a good one and would have scored well in the "centered" challenge, but I fear it will not do as well here as the DOF is not well represented.', '2004-06-13 07:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(761192, 81827, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good action shot but the railing in the backround takes away from the feeling of the picture. That is obviously out of your control but none the less affects the overall quality of the scene.</td>', 'Good action shot but the railing in the backround takes away from the feeling of the picture. That is obviously out of your control but none the less affects the overall quality of the scene.', '2004-06-13 07:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(761194, 80826, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but it doesn''t really exemplify a Deep DOF as the backround is blurry.</td>', 'Cute picture but it doesn''t really exemplify a Deep DOF as the backround is blurry.', '2004-06-13 07:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(761195, 81832, 3306, '<td valign="top">Had the whole picture been in focus you would have scored much better.</td>', 'Had the whole picture been in focus you would have scored much better.', '2004-06-13 07:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(761197, 81905, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. You have capture the DOF nicely by taking this picture from a slight distance from the subject. That is quite a waterfall. I am interested to see where it is.</td>', 'Nice shot. You have capture the DOF nicely by taking this picture from a slight distance from the subject. That is quite a waterfall. I am interested to see where it is.', '2004-06-13 07:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(761199, 81962, 3306, '<td valign="top">Satisfies the theme. I am wondering what your picture would have looked like if you took it from a lower angle and were a little closer to the rocks. I think it might have given it more of a feeling of depth and brought the viewer into the picture a little more.</td>', 'Satisfies the theme. I am wondering what your picture would have looked like if you took it from a lower angle and were a little closer to the rocks. I think it might have given it more of a feeling of depth and brought the viewer into the picture a little more.', '2004-06-13 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(761200, 81923, 1009, '<td valign="top">NIce deep DOF. I like the subject matter too, it reminds me of working summers on a ranch in Oregon. Great job...</td>', 'NIce deep DOF. I like the subject matter too, it reminds me of working summers on a ranch in Oregon. Great job...', '2004-06-13 07:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(761201, 81809, 1009, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, the way the foreground is blacked out and the DOF make it a very interesting shot... good job.</td>', 'I really like this one, the way the foreground is blacked out and the DOF make it a very interesting shot... good job.', '2004-06-13 07:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(761204, 81682, 1009, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I would have liked to see a little more of the right side of the image though. Nice use of deep DOF, good job overall.</td>', 'Neat shot, I would have liked to see a little more of the right side of the image though. Nice use of deep DOF, good job overall.', '2004-06-13 07:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(761205, 81831, 1009, '<td valign="top">Wow, very simple yet great shot. Almost perfect for this challenge. With a little work tweaking this photo I think you could have a winner here. Good job!</td>', 'Wow, very simple yet great shot. Almost perfect for this challenge. With a little work tweaking this photo I think you could have a winner here. Good job!', '2004-06-13 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(761207, 81062, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like teh colors and the way you managed the deep DOF. I don''t usually like shots that are tilted this much, but here you pulled it off with pleasant results. Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like teh colors and the way you managed the deep DOF. I don''t usually like shots that are tilted this much, but here you pulled it off with pleasant results. Good job.', '2004-06-13 07:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(761208, 81935, 1009, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I don''t feel that it demonstrates deep DOF all that well. It could just be me though. One thing is for certain, I bet those guys have a hell of a view. Wish I was up there with my camera! Good job...</td>', 'I like this shot but I don''t feel that it demonstrates deep DOF all that well. It could just be me though. One thing is for certain, I bet those guys have a hell of a view. Wish I was up there with my camera! Good job...', '2004-06-13 07:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(761209, 80789, 1009, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like the vibrant greens and the crop adds to the shot too. Good job.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like the vibrant greens and the crop adds to the shot too. Good job.', '2004-06-13 07:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(761210, 81426, 1009, '<td valign="top">NIce shot. I like the use of selective desaturation here, along with the blown out skies. Makes for a dramatic image. Good job...</td>', 'NIce shot. I like the use of selective desaturation here, along with the blown out skies. Makes for a dramatic image. Good job...', '2004-06-13 07:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(761211, 80694, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot on this one, wish it had just a little something more to it though. Not sure what, I just feel like its missing something. Good job though...</td>', 'Nice shot on this one, wish it had just a little something more to it though. Not sure what, I just feel like its missing something. Good job though...', '2004-06-13 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(761214, 80655, 1009, '<td valign="top">I think this one should place near the top, ideally top 10 or higher. Great job on the deep DOF, nice silky smooth image (300D/10D?), great color saturation. Wow...</td>', 'I think this one should place near the top, ideally top 10 or higher. Great job on the deep DOF, nice silky smooth image (300D/10D?), great color saturation. Wow...', '2004-06-13 07:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(761215, 81949, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice to see some more people taking advantage of those exciting urban landscapes. Nice job...</td>', 'Cool shot, nice to see some more people taking advantage of those exciting urban landscapes. Nice job...', '2004-06-13 07:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(761216, 81903, 1009, '<td valign="top">I like what you''re trying to do here but feel like it needs just a little something more to make it jump out at me. Good work, tweak it a little and I think you''ll be on to a winner.</td>', 'I like what you''re trying to do here but feel like it needs just a little something more to make it jump out at me. Good work, tweak it a little and I think you''ll be on to a winner.', '2004-06-13 07:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(761217, 81584, 1009, '<td valign="top">NIce idea for a shot. Wish I thought of stuff like this. Good job and a well done entry for deep DOF.</td>', 'NIce idea for a shot. Wish I thought of stuff like this. Good job and a well done entry for deep DOF.', '2004-06-13 07:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
