(761253, 81472, 8624, '<td valign="top">a nice cropped view of the city. I like the lighting except for the blown highlights on the lighter buildings. The "Locust on the Park" sign is an unfortunate distraction to an otherwise clean cityscape.</td>', 'a nice cropped view of the city. I like the lighting except for the blown highlights on the lighter buildings. The "Locust on the Park" sign is an unfortunate distraction to an otherwise clean cityscape.', '2004-06-13 10:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(761255, 81647, 8125, '<td valign="top">Tough shot to get with your available lighting.  Some filler flash might have helped with some of the dark spots.</td>', 'Tough shot to get with your available lighting.  Some filler flash might have helped with some of the dark spots.', '2004-06-13 10:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(761257, 81727, 8125, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see the ''how you did it'' when the challenge is over.  :-)<br/>Great idea.  I would love to be able to shoot the moon like you have.  Cool shot!</td>', 'I can''t wait to see the ''how you did it'' when the challenge is over.  :-)Great idea.  I would love to be able to shoot the moon like you have.  Cool shot!', '2004-06-13 10:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
