(761259, 81957, 8125, '<td valign="top">Another of the photos in this challenge where I can''t wait to see how you did it.  I liked this shot from the first time I saw it.</td>', 'Another of the photos in this challenge where I can''t wait to see how you did it.  I liked this shot from the first time I saw it.', '2004-06-13 10:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
