(761269, 81298, 8125, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, being against a black background just makes them stand out even more.  Excellent work.  I''d like to see this same subject at different angles.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, being against a black background just makes them stand out even more.  Excellent work.  I''d like to see this same subject at different angles.', '2004-06-13 10:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
