(761277, 81949, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this viewpoint, my only critique is that the sky is blown out.  If you could get this same shot with a nice blue sky and maybe even some puffy clouds - it would be perfect.</td>', 'I really like this viewpoint, my only critique is that the sky is blown out.  If you could get this same shot with a nice blue sky and maybe even some puffy clouds - it would be perfect.', '2004-06-13 10:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
