(761998, 80457, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the moon, but the only focus here is at infinity (VERY shallow DOF). Wait for a plane to fly over the moon, and you''ve got a ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the moon, but the only focus here is at infinity (VERY shallow DOF). Wait for a plane to fly over the moon, and you''ve got a ribbon.', '2004-06-14 00:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
