icture you can spot this old tree that has been hit by lightning: Btw the wild one: and the rest of the family says hi. :)(btw2 this last picture was taken by the pine trees at the back of the "Wild One" picture...', '2004-06-14 04:10:53.000000', '2004-06-14 04:15:54.000000', 0),
