(762531, 81727, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - now that''s some work and serious thought you put into this photograph.  Even if you used another photo as your background - still excellent work and original thinking - that''s what this is about.  :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing the ''how you did it''.  Inspires me to continue thinking outside the box....</td>', 'Wow - now that''s some work and serious thought you put into this photograph.  Even if you used another photo as your background - still excellent work and original thinking - that''s what this is about.  :-) Thanks for sharing the ''how you did it''.  Inspires me to continue thinking outside the box....', '2004-06-14 09:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
