(762567, 80457, 10402, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BooZon:</b></div><hr/><i> Upside down miss jane :)  (10) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not actually upside down, but certainly a mirror image of how the moon appears in the sky. This is common for catadioptric scopes like the one Ramon used.</td>', 'Originally posted by BooZon: Upside down miss jane :)  (10)   Not actually upside down, but certainly a mirror image of how the moon appears in the sky. This is common for catadioptric scopes like the one Ramon used.', '2004-06-14 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(762577, 81132, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m just thrilled to have finally won a ribbon.  Now my husband has to take me out to dinner - we made a deal over a year ago that if I ever won a ribbon he''d take me out for a fancy dinner.  :)  Thanks everyone who voted.  I watched my score go up and up all week and thought maybe there was a reverse April fool''s joke going on.<br/> <br/>This place is seriously one of the most beautiful places in the world - I hardly feel right taking the credit for what nature did.  All I had to do was click the shutter.  :)  I used to go camping at this little remote place all the time, but hadn''t been there for several years.  When I saw this contest pop up, I thought it would be the perfect place if the weather would just cooperate, so I hopped in my car and drove up there.  I took lots of great shots that day, but I''m glad I chose this one as my final entry. <br/> <br/>Thanks again...</td>', 'I''m just thrilled to have finally won a ribbon.  Now my husband has to take me out to dinner - we made a deal over a year ago that if I ever won a ribbon he''d take me out for a fancy dinner.  :)  Thanks everyone who voted.  I watched my score go up and up all week and thought maybe there was a reverse April fool''s joke going on. This place is seriously one of the most beautiful places in the world - I hardly feel right taking the credit for what nature did.  All I had to do was click the shutter.  :)  I used to go camping at this little remote place all the time, but hadn''t been there for several years.  When I saw this contest pop up, I thought it would be the perfect place if the weather would just cooperate, so I hopped in my car and drove up there.  I took lots of great shots that day, but I''m glad I chose this one as my final entry.  Thanks again...', '2004-06-14 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(762586, 81132, 1202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture by a most deserving photographer.  Congratulations on the win.</td>', 'Wonderful picture by a most deserving photographer.  Congratulations on the win.', '2004-06-14 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(762618, 81902, 12448, '<td valign="top">I want one!!!!!! Of the ponies that is!  Great shot, it had a 10 from me and a top three spot, alas I was wrong :(  You were ROBBED! :)<br/> <br/>Deannda<br/>Beautiful shot, when will the print be available?<br/></td>', 'I want one!!!!!! Of the ponies that is!  Great shot, it had a 10 from me and a top three spot, alas I was wrong :(  You were ROBBED! :) DeanndaBeautiful shot, when will the print be available?', '2004-06-14 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
