(762659, 81911, 7969, '<td valign="top">title-- the titile comes from the name of the park the shot was taken at... golden ears provincial park, in BC, in a stretch I thought maybe the yellow canoes could make a link perhaps looking a little like ''big ears''.<br/></td>', 'title-- the titile comes from the name of the park the shot was taken at... golden ears provincial park, in BC, in a stretch I thought maybe the yellow canoes could make a link perhaps looking a little like ''big ears''.', '2004-06-14 12:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(762667, 81961, 5112, '<td valign="top">I more or less figured this would be your picture.  It''s beautiful.  I''m not sure why I like this picture, maybe because it has so much water in it, and I could just get lost there, in all that blue.  Oh well.</td>', 'I more or less figured this would be your picture.  It''s beautiful.  I''m not sure why I like this picture, maybe because it has so much water in it, and I could just get lost there, in all that blue.  Oh well.', '2004-06-14 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(762677, 81132, 12252, '<td valign="top">Just an incredible, fantastic image which DEFINES landscape photography and sets the bar for me to aim at (I think that''s poor grammar, but you get the point!). Good stuff. Really, really good stuff.</td>', 'Just an incredible, fantastic image which DEFINES landscape photography and sets the bar for me to aim at (I think that''s poor grammar, but you get the point!). Good stuff. Really, really good stuff.', '2004-06-14 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(762711, 81964, 7560, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out how it got a one either. :) This is a shot of the Washington Monument framed through the pillars of the Jefferson Memorial. It was a pretty overcast day, so there''s not much color to the shot. I''m wokring to reshoot this when I have some better sky color working for me. :) <br/> <br/>Special thanks to my editing team, who foreced me to submit this at the last minute. I appreciate it guys! If you gave me a 1, drop me a note and let me know why. I''m interested in more ways to improve the shot.</td>', 'I can''t figure out how it got a one either. :) This is a shot of the Washington Monument framed through the pillars of the Jefferson Memorial. It was a pretty overcast day, so there''s not much color to the shot. I''m wokring to reshoot this when I have some better sky color working for me. :)  Special thanks to my editing team, who foreced me to submit this at the last minute. I appreciate it guys! If you gave me a 1, drop me a note and let me know why. I''m interested in more ways to improve the shot.', '2004-06-14 13:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(762716, 81132, 6388, '<td valign="top">You put those 8 megapixels to good use Jodie.  I''ve been to that lake (and a hundred others like it) and never made them look this good.  well done.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'You put those 8 megapixels to good use Jodie.  I''ve been to that lake (and a hundred others like it) and never made them look this good.  well done. Pedro', '2004-06-14 13:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(762717, 81132, 7560, '<td valign="top">This was as close to a no-brainer 10 as it gets. The first time in ages that an image jumped out at me, grabbed me by the throat, and yelled, ''GIMME A 10!''<br/> <br/>Very agressive photo you have there jodi. :) <br/> <br/></td>', 'This was as close to a no-brainer 10 as it gets. The first time in ages that an image jumped out at me, grabbed me by the throat, and yelled, ''GIMME A 10!'' Very agressive photo you have there jodi. :)  ', '2004-06-14 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(762724, 81455, 6388, '<td valign="top">Man i can''t wait to see wht you''re gonna be able to do when you get that D70.  awesome :)<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'Man i can''t wait to see wht you''re gonna be able to do when you get that D70.  awesome :) P', '2004-06-14 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
