(763107, 81528, 4493, '<td valign="top">Thanks, it''s actually the 12-24 @ 24. I basically held the camera over my head, pointed in the general direction and snapped. This was one of about 4 shots I took of that field.<br/> <br/>-danny<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pedro:</b></div><hr/><i> fasntastic Danny.  Love it.  that''s the 12-24 at 12mm I assume?<br/> <br/>P </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks, it''s actually the 12-24 @ 24. I basically held the camera over my head, pointed in the general direction and snapped. This was one of about 4 shots I took of that field. -danny Originally posted by Pedro: fasntastic Danny.  Love it.  that''s the 12-24 at 12mm I assume? P ', '2004-06-14 18:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(763136, 81069, 15891, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! At first viewing, I immediately thought "Alice in Wonderland" - not because it reminded of it exactly but more because you have managed to take something really mundane (a tree!) and turn it into an almost mystical image. Awesome job!</td>', 'I love this shot! At first viewing, I immediately thought "Alice in Wonderland" - not because it reminded of it exactly but more because you have managed to take something really mundane (a tree!) and turn it into an almost mystical image. Awesome job!', '2004-06-14 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(763172, 81923, 21362, '<td valign="top">I wish this had done a little better, it was in my top ten anyway. It makes me want to take my shoes off and run towards that cabin. Rolling green hills always do that to me. :)</td>', 'I wish this had done a little better, it was in my top ten anyway. It makes me want to take my shoes off and run towards that cabin. Rolling green hills always do that to me. :)', '2004-06-14 19:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(763218, 81579, 7322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by d14:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve come back and looked at this shot nearly 20 times now.  Truly beautiful.  I thought this would wind up in the top ten.  I can''t believe you think my entry should have scored higher than this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gee! Thanks so much! What a nice comment! Each challenge is making me care less and less about where I place. I mean, I get aggravated when I see the kind of shots that score higher than my personal picks or my own shots but the past few challenges I''ve made sure to enter something I really like and I''ve gotten some nice comments and I know I''m improving. I think that I will probably never have the kind of style that wins ribbons on this site (but who knows?). I''m managing to stick with it and for me, as a person with ADHD, that is a huge win in itself. Good luck, keep shooting, and thanks again!</td>', 'Originally posted by d14: I''ve come back and looked at this shot nearly 20 times now.  Truly beautiful.  I thought this would wind up in the top ten.  I can''t believe you think my entry should have scored higher than this.   Gee! Thanks so much! What a nice comment! Each challenge is making me care less and less about where I place. I mean, I get aggravated when I see the kind of shots that score higher than my personal picks or my own shots but the past few challenges I''ve made sure to enter something I really like and I''ve gotten some nice comments and I know I''m improving. I think that I will probably never have the kind of style that wins ribbons on this site (but who knows?). I''m managing to stick with it and for me, as a person with ADHD, that is a huge win in itself. Good luck, keep shooting, and thanks again!', '2004-06-14 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(763228, 81902, 1368, '<td valign="top">Thank you I will make prints as soon as someone teaches me how to do that :) I´m to lazy to try to figure it out myself :p</td>', 'Thank you I will make prints as soon as someone teaches me how to do that :) I´m to lazy to try to figure it out myself :p', '2004-06-14 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(763235, 81684, 10082, '<td valign="top">Interesting that so many don''t see the DOF. I guess because I shoot a lot of macro, I''m very impressed that you managed such great DOF. You are usually lucky to just get the bug in focus, much less most of the flower. I''m rarely able to get DOF to this degree on a macro like this. Great job !</td>', 'Interesting that so many don''t see the DOF. I guess because I shoot a lot of macro, I''m very impressed that you managed such great DOF. You are usually lucky to just get the bug in focus, much less most of the flower. I''m rarely able to get DOF to this degree on a macro like this. Great job !', '2004-06-14 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
