(853907, 81951, 15407, '<td valign="top">Anna,  You hit the nail on the head with the detail being lost on the lens / "f128".  The clouds &amp; fog came rolling in off the coast and I had to keep moving the camera to get light on the lens and f-stops and ran out of time.  Thank you for providing me with this critigue.</td>', 'Anna,  You hit the nail on the head with the detail being lost on the lens / "f128".  The clouds & fog came rolling in off the coast and I had to keep moving the camera to get light on the lens and f-stops and ran out of time.  Thank you for providing me with this critigue.', '2004-08-11 03:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
