(5805105, 81069, 69008, '<td valign="top">DOF is great with my old 15mm fisheye, and it seems that you have universal focus at f16 and 12mm with this lens.  Great choice of subject and POV make this a fine shot. I like that you left it color, so that the different elements stand out from each other.  It just looks very natural, and not over processed.</td>', 'DOF is great with my old 15mm fisheye, and it seems that you have universal focus at f16 and 12mm with this lens.  Great choice of subject and POV make this a fine shot. I like that you left it color, so that the different elements stand out from each other.  It just looks very natural, and not over processed.', '2010-01-10 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
